<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Hunde Nouveau Testament</book>
  <para style="h">MARIKO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu Kirisitu nga ko Mariko aandikaa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="mt2">nga ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mariko</para>
  <para style="mt2">aandikaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Bwingiro</para>
  <para style="ip">Mariko abwerekya ku Yesu Kirisitru ye Muala wa Ongo, na kandi iye Muala wa Mundu. Abwerekya kandi ku Yesu awichaa kwebula mbu akolere abandu neihira kubo nge aba mutulo weufulabo. Mar10:45, Yesu abula mbu: «Ingye, muala wa Mundu nitawichaa kwebula mbu abandu berenikolera, wetuwe nawichaa kwebula mbu nerekolerebo nehana abuyingo bwani, kwebula mbu niufule bandu bangi.» Mariko yaandikire akitabo kino, alukwa kandi mbu ye Yohana-Mariko (Mikolere 12:12). Mariko uyu atabaa muuma wa mwa ndumwa ikumi nebiri sa Yesu, wetuwe abaa muuma wa bobabaa banahereketsa andumwa ya Yesu Kirisitu, Petero. Binwa bingi mu byo Mariko aandikaa kuluenda Yesu, aumpfaabyo itsukira Petero. Mariko nianaandika akitabo kino kwebula mbu kipfule aMwatsi Mubuya ku bobate Bayahuti. Mweandika akitabo kino, atalaa ku byobiandikirwe mwa Ndaane ya kwa Mira nga ko Matayo akolaa. Wetuwe itangira kwa kiche kibere ihikira ku kya munane, na kya rekumi, Marko abwerekya byo Yesu akolaa mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya. Ihuluka kwa kiche kya rekumi ihikira ku kya arekumi na ndatu, abwerekya byo Yesu akolaa mwa kyango kye Yuteya na mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu. Kwemala, ni yaneena kuluenda alupfu lwa Yesu kwa musalaba na repfuka liwe. Mwa bitabo bine bya mwa Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu, akitabo kya Mariko kyokyufi irengya abindi. Mwa kitabo kino, Mariko ahirire abwenge buwe kutsibu kwa binwa bya tushingishiro to Yesu akolaa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Amahubiri ma Yohana Murubiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ino yo ndangiro ya Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char> Muala wa Ongo, <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />ngakuno kokyaandikwaa mwa kitabo kya <char style="w" lemma="mutahwa">mutahwa</char> Isaya mbu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:2">«Ongo aneena mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">‹Muumpfe! Nalika andumwa yani mbu ikuxondolere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">kwebula mbu ikutemulire anchira.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Malaki 3:1.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Amulenge ahuluka mwa bweru mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‹Mutunganyanye anchira ya Ninakuwetu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Mulingiriranye anchira yakatsukamo!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 40:3.</char></note>»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Niyo Yohana Murubiki apfumbuka ni arubika mwa bweru, nehubiri abandu mbu bahingye amiberere yabo, ne Ongo akashashirabo asantsambi sabo.<verse eid="MRK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Becha mwa kyango kye Yuteya na bangi be Yerusalemu bashingana Yohana. Niabanaikiritsa asantsambi sabo soshe, ne Yohana ni ererubikabo mwa lwichi lwe Yorotani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana abaa anereimbala lukimba lolukolirwe mu byoya bya ngamiya na mukoba wa luhu mwa mbindi. Abaa analya mikuku na buki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yohana abaa anabwira abandu mbu: «Yahika ira nyuma kwingye anilengitse maala, nani nitalirene kiro na hake, iyindama kweminula amiriki ya kwa bilyato biwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ingye anibarubika mu mechi, wetuwe iye akabarubika mu Mutima Akomire.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu arubikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mo kianiro umo, Yesu nianatenga i Nasareti mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya, nianarubikwa ne Yohana mwa lwichi lwe Yorotani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu abere amerubikwa netenga mwa mechi, nianaxunga kwa mbingu yamekingukala na Mutima Akomire nianamukimirako ngakuno ikuku. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Na mulenge nianaumpfibwa ni atenga mu mbingu mbu: «Iwe, we Muala wani mutsiyirwa, unanimoya kutsibu.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Mo kashangi umoho, aMutima Akomire nianatwala Yesu mwa bweru, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />nianashibamo biro makumi ane. Neyo, Shitani nianamuereka. Aikalaa iyo mwa kati ka sanyamexwa, na bamalaika ni abamukolera.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abirangira abemitsa babere.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yohana abere amehirwa mwa nyumba ya muliki, Yesu nianaya mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya. Iyo nianapfula aMwatsi Mubuya watenga ira mwa Ongo. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Abaa ereneena mbu: «Akashangi kameeraho, na bwami bwa Ongo bwahara hofi. Muhingye amiberere yenyu neimirira aMwatsi Mubuya.»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Mwa mango Yesu abaa atsuka kwa musike wa ngetsi ye Ngalilaya, nianaxunga bahyana babiri, Simoni ne Andereya muala wabo, ni abauma amakira mabo mwa ngetsi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Munikulikire nikabaira bahyana ba bandu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Mo kashangi umoho niabanasiya amakira mabo nemukulikira.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu nianaya ira buxondotsi hake, nianaxunga Yakobo muala wa Sebetayo, ne Yohana muala wabo. Babaa bali mu bwato bwabo ni abaxuwa amakira mabo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Mo kashangi umoho, Yesu nianabirangirabo, niabanasiya Sebetayo ishe wabo mwa bwato na bakotsi bewe, niabanakulikira Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mundu wa bixwatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanaya mwa mulungu we Kaperenaumu. Mwa lwire lwa Sabato, Yesu nianaingira mwa <char style="w" lemma="sinakoki">sinakoki</char> netangira iiyisa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Abandu bobahulikyaa abinwa byabaa aiyisa bashishala kutsibu, kubwishi abaa ataiyisa ngakuno abeyisa ba Muomba, wetuwe ni aiyisabo mu maala.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Mo kashangi umoho, mundu muuma yabaa aundirwe na kixwatsi abaa ali mwa <char style="w" lemma="sinakoki">sinakoki</char> umo. Amundu uyo nianalaka mbu: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Ee, Yesu we Nasareti! Autuxondakoki? Mbeni uhikire kwetuhwerekeretsa? Nikwichi kushe. Iwe, wo Ukomire yalikirwe ne Ongo.»<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu nianakemera akixwatsi ikyo kutsibu mbu: «Tsira, ube netenga mwa mundu uyu!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Akixwatsi ikyo kihiriyanya amundu uyo kutsibu, netenga muye, ni akilaka kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Abandu boshe niabanashishala kutsibu, nebutsabutsanya mbu: «Tutatsatwaxunga ku kiri ngeki! Mwa kuli ameyiso aya ma iyisa mali na maala! Amundu uyu, binabe na bixwatsi, ateekabyo mu maala nabyo ni byaba nemuumpfirsa!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Angulu mbuya ya Yesu niainashanchana chuba mwa kyango kyoshe kye Ngalilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya bakoni bangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe babere bahuluka mwa sinakoki, niabanaya mwa nyumba ya Simoni ne Andereya, ni bali kuuma ne Yakobo ne Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Netsala wa Simoni ni aonchire ku ngyingo, kubwishi ni alwere shishira. Yesu abere ahika iyo, niabanamupfulira amwatsi wa bukoni bwa mukatsi uyo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu nianaipfunda hofi naye, nianamutsimba kwa kuboko nemuimanya; nianalama, aba netangira imutekulira bilyo.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Mwe luoloolo, aretsuba rabere ramehumbirira, niabanaletera Yesu abandu boshe bobabaa balwere, na bobabaa baundirwe na bixwatsi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Abandu boshe ba kwa mutsi babaa babuanene ha lukyo lwa nyumba iyo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu nianalamya bandu bangi bobabaa balwere makoni ma lwawelwawe. Nianahentsa bixwatsi bingi, atasiyiraabyo kiro na kashangi keneena, kubwishi ni bichi ku Yesu yende.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atenga i Kaperenaumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mwe lutumbi, Yesu nianasisimuka, nianatenga mwa mutsi, nianaya handu ho hatali bandu. Iyo nianatangira ihema. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na balikyabo niabanaya imuxonda. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Nabo babere bamemuxunga, niabanamubwira mbu: «Abandu boshe abakuxonda.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Wetuwe Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Tuye mu indi mitsi yo iri hofi na uno nge naya ipfula iyo Amwatsi wa Ongo. Kubwishi ikyo kyo kituma nihika.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Nianatsuka mwa kyango kyoshe kye Ngalilaya, ni ahubiri mwa <char style="w" lemma="masinakoki">masinakoki</char> nehentsa abixwatsi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akomya mubentsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Mubentsi muuma nianawicha ho Yesu ali, nepfukama mwa mbere siwe. Nianaitondoola kwiye mbu: «Uli ushashire, ungakocha inikomya.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu nianamupfira bwoncho, nianalambula aminwe, nianamupfulako, nemubwira mbu: «Anixonda mbu ukomibwe!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Mo kashangi umumoho abibentsi bya mundu uyo nianakomibwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianamuteeka kutsibu nemubwira mbu: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />«Umpfa kushe, utabwiraa kiro na mundu akinwa iki. Wetuwe youibwerekye kwa mukungu wa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char>, inyuma kwaho ni waleta mutulo nga ko Musa ateekaa, kweba kaliho kwa bandu boshe ku wamekomibwa.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Wetuwe amundu uyo abere aenda, nianatangira ipfula amwatsi uyo ahoshe. Na kubwishi bwekyo Yesu atakocha kandi iingira kyenene mu mutsi woshewoshe, wetuwe aikala hale ho hatali bandu. Na bandu beremuhikira ni abatenga kwa minda yoshe.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mukoni wa makonongola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Inyuma ya biro bike, Yesu nianafuluka i Kaperenaumu, na bandu niabanaumpfao mbu ali mu nyumba. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Bandu bangi babuanana aho, nehikira ku luero lwehusha buali ho bangatsuka kwa lukyo lwa nyumba. Mwa mango Yesu abaa apfulirabo aKinwa kya Ongo, <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />niabanamuletera mukoni wa makonongola, yabaa ahetwe na bandu bane. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Wetuwe kubwishi bwa mubuanano wa bandu, bahusha kobangamuleta mwa mbere sa Yesu. Niyo batobola hambashiro wa nyumba yo Yesu abaa alimo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayahuti bauma babaa banahimba batya: ni banalambika miti iraluulu wa nyumba ngakuno kishesha, noko ni kwebatondeka amatebura ngakuno bishakalo. Na kwa nyumba ni kunaba muurukiro.</char></note> Niabanamukimya ku mundara mwa mbere sa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu abere axunga abwimire bwa bandu abo, nianabwira amukoni wa makonongola mbu: «Mwana wani asantsambi sawe sameshashirwa.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Beyisa bauma ba Muomba bobabaa aho niabanaanikira mwa myete yabo mbu: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Kubwishi bwaki amundu uyu angakamba Ongo? Inde mundu yangashashira ntsambi ali ate Ongo yewene?» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Aho, Yesu nianakengula mwa mwete uwe amianikire yabo, nianabutsabo mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amuibutsiritsa abinwa byoshe ibi? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Kihe kyekyolo, kwebwira amundu wa makonongola mbu: ‹Asantsambi sawe sameshashirwa›, neri imubwira mbu: ‹Batuka, tsimba amundara wawe ube neenda?› <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Anixonda mbu mumenye ku Muala wa Mundu awete maala meshashira asantsambi kwa kihuo kuno.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:10">Kubatyo nianabwira amundu wa makonongola uyo mbu: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Anikubwira mbu batuka, tsimba amundara wawe ube nefuluka hamwawe!» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Na bandu boshe babere bali yobalola kwa mundu uyo, mo kashangi umo nianaimana, nianatsimba amundara uwe neiendera. Abandu boshe bashishala, basingya Ongo mbu: «Tutatsatwaxunga binwa biri ngebi kiro na hake!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abirangira Lawi mbu amukulikire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Inyuma kwaho Yesu nianaya kandi kwa musike wa ngetsi ye Ngalilaya. Mubuanano wa bandu bangi abaa eremukulikira, ne Yesu ni ereiyisabo. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Abere ali yatsuka, nianaxunga Lawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Matayo 9:9, Lawi yanalukwa kandi Matayo. </char></note> muala wa Alufayo, ni aikere mwa nyumba yarefutishiramo akoli. Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Nikulikire!» Lawi nianabatuka nemukulikira. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianalya biryo mwa nyumba ya Lawi. Bafutishi bangi ba koli, na bakotsi bangi ba ntsambi, balya bilyo kuuma ne Yesu na bemitsa bewe, kubwishi bandu bangi bali ngakuno abo bobabaa baneremukulikira. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Mwa mango abeyisa ba Muomba ba kikanga kya Bafarisayo babere baxunga ku Yesu alya kuuma na bandu abo, niabanabutsa abemitsa bewe mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amwiyisa wenyu alya kuuma na bafutishi ba koli na bakotsi ba santsambi?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu abere aumpfa kobaneena, nianabwirabo mbu: «Abakambwe batalaa ku munganga, wetuwe abakoni bobanamulaako. Nitawichaa ibirangira bobatunganene, wetuwe abakotsi ba santsambi.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahemo meihangira ilya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Abemitsa ba Yohana Murubiki na Bafarisayo babaa banaihangira ilya. Bandu bauma bahika nebutsa Yesu mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki abemitsa ba Yohana Murubiki na bemitsa ba Bafarisayo banaihangira ilya, wetuwe abemitsa bawe bataihangira ilya?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Amuanikira mbu bobalalikirwe mwa buheruki bangaihangira ilya bilyo bya linye mwa mango nina abuheruki akinali kuuma nabo? Ihi! Mwa mango akineho batangakocha iihangira ilya.» <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Wetuwe kwendehika lwire lo nina buheruki endetengyibwa mwa kati kabo, mo biro umo, mobakendeihangira ilya.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Hatali mundu yanalandira kiraka kihya ku lukimba lukulire. Akekola atyo, akiraka kihya ikyo ni kikaberenga alukimba lo lukulire, na rebereka ralo ni raiongerera kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Hatali mundu yangahira tifai nyihya mu abipfûma bya luhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBayahuti babaa banakolesa ngaha sosikolirwe mu nyuhu sa nyamexwa.</char></note> lukulire. Akekola atyo, atifai nyihya iyo ni ikaberenga abipfûma bya luhu lolukulire, na tifai na bipfûma byoshe, ni byapfa busha. Wetuwe lirirene ihira atifai nyihya mu bipfûma bihya bya luhu.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ye Nina aSabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Lwire luuma lwa Sabato, Yesu abaa atsuka mu maxwa ma ngano. Mwa luendo lwabo, abemitsa bewe batangira ihulula bikumba bya ngano. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />aBafarisayo niabanamubwira mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki abemitsa bawe abakola binwa bya Muomba wetu ahangire ikola mu lwire lwa Sabato?»<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Mbeni Mutatsamwasoma akinwa kyo mwami Ndauti akolaa mwa mango abaa alaire ku bilyo, iye na bandu babaa ali nabo ni bakukwitse? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Mbeni ataingiraa mwa nyumba ya Ongo, nelya kwa mikati yo ikomire yobabaa bametula Ongo? Akinwa ikyo kyakolwaa mwa mango Abiyatari abaa shebakungu. Abakungu ho bobabaa baherwe arubu lwelya amikati iyo. Wetuwe Ndauti alyaa kuyo, neha bobabaa ali kuuma nabo?» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesu nianaxuba ibwirabo mbu: «Alwire lwa Sabato lwaterekwaa kubwishi bwa bandu, wetuwe amundu atabumbwaa kubwishi bwa Sabato. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kubwishi bwekyo, Muala wa Mundu ye Nina aSabato.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mukoni mu lwire lwa Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianaxuba iingira mwa <char style="w" lemma="sinakoki">sinakoki</char>. Nomo mwabaa mundu muuma wa makonongola mwa minwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />aBafarisayo bobabaa bali umo, niabanasita Yesu yo mesha kutsibu kwemenya ngakuno akalamya amundu uyo mwa lwire lwa Sabato, kubwishi babaa ni abamuxondako kinwa kyemusongera. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu nianabwira amundu uyo mbu: «Batuka uimane ha katikati ka bandu.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Niyo abutsa abandu bobabaa bali aho mbu: «Mbeni aMuomba atuhere rubu lwekola bibuya neri ikola bibi mu lwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">Sabato</char>? Ilamya mundu neri imwita? Wetuwe hataba mundu yaneena kinwa kyoshekyoshe.» <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu nianasitabo amesha mu butsibuke kubwishi bwa myete yabo mitsibu. Nianabwira amundu uyo mbu: «Lambula aminwe yawe.» Nianalambula aminwe, niainalama. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />aBafarisayo niabanahuluka mwa sinakoki neya isimola na kikanga kya Herote kwekola nama yeita Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu bangi bahikira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanaenda bonabene kwa musike wa ngetsi ye Ngalilaya. Na mubuanano munene wa bandu nianamukulikira. Abandu babaa abatenga mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya na kye Yuteya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />ne Yerusalemu, na mwa kihuo kye Itumeya, na mwa kihuo kya kwa lindi ishirya ra lwichi lwe Yorotani, na mwa kyango kye Tiro ne Sitona. Bandu bangi berehikira Yesu kubwishi ni bameumpfa abinwa byoshe byerekola. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Niyo Yesu abwira abemitsa bewe mbu bamuteanyitse bwato buuma kwebula mbu amubuanano atamupfundeeretsaa. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Abandu bobabaa na makoni berehumirana kwebula mbu bahike harali nemupfulako kubwishi alamyaa bandu bangi. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Na mwa mango bobabaa baundirwe na bixwatsi baxungaa Yesu, niabanapfukama mwa mbere siwe nelaka mbu: «Iwe uli Muala wa Ongo.» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Wetuwe Yesu nianateekabo kutsibu mbu batapfuliraao mundu kwiye yende.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondola abemitsa ikumi na babiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Inyuma kwaho Yesu nianauruka kwa kitwa, nianabirangira abemitsa babaa alaireko, nabo niabanahika harali. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Nianalondola mubo ikumi na babiri balukaa mbu ndumwa, kwebula mbu babe kuuma naye nelikabo kwepfula amwatsi wa Ongo, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />nehabo maala mehentsa abixwatsi. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Arekumi na babiri abo balondolaa ni bobano: Simoni yo Yesu atolaa aretsina kandi mbu ye Petero, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobo, ne mualabo mbu ye Yohana, ababiri boshe ni baala ba Sebetayo. Yesu alukaabo mbu: «Boanereke» (rebula mbu murungumano wa mulashano), <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andereya, ne Firipo, ne Baritolomayo, ne Matayo, ne Tomasi, ne Yakobo muala wa Alufayo, ne Taleo, ne Simoni wa mwa kikanga kya Baselote, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ne Yuta Isikariyote, yahotaa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu axondwa na kipfunga kiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianafuluka mwa nyumba. Mubuanano munene wa bandu nianaxuba ikorana. Na kubwishi bwekyo Yesu na bemitsa bewe batabonekya kashangi kelya bilyo. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Mwa mango abandu ba kipfunga kiwe baumpfaa abinwa ibyo, niabanaya imubinga, kubwishi bereneena mbu ahara musire.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abeyisa ba Muomba baluka Yesu mbu ye Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Abeyisa ba Muomba bobatengaa i Yerusalemu baneena kuluenda Yesu mbu: «Aundirwe ne Belisebuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aretsina «Belisebuli», lindi itsina ra Shitani.</char></note>.» Na bandi nabo baneena mbu: «Amukulukulu wa bixwatsi yeremuha amaala marehentsa abixwatsi.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Niyo Yesu abirangira abeisa ba Muomba, nebwirabo mu mishinga mbu: «Bate ko Shitani angaihentsa yewene?» <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Bandu ba bwami buuma bakerelwa bonabene ku bonabene, abwami ubo ni bukashambukala. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Na bandu ba nyumba nguma bakerelwa bonabene ku bonabene, akipfunga ikyo ni kitendeba na maala kiro na hake. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ali Shitani angailwisa yewene, na bwami buwe bukeabana, amaala mewe ni makahwa, na bwami buwe ni bukahera. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Amundu atangakocha iingira mu nyumba ya mundu wa nyiki, nemunyaa abindu byaweteko ali atatsamumina. Wetuwe amekinda imumina, ni yangakocha iheka abindu biwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku abandu bendeshashirwa asantsambi sabo soshe, na sangambo soshe sobakolera Ongo. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Wetuwe amundu yangakamba aMutima Akomire, atendeshashirwa kiro na hake. Endeheka antsambi ihikira kwa ntsindiro. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu abwiraabo atyo, kubwishi baneenaa mbu: «Aundirwe na kixwatsi.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baala babo Yesu ne nina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Mwa kashangi umo, baala babo Yesu ne nina niabanahika neimana ha mbuwa. Niabanalika mundu mbu amubirangire. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Mubuanano munene wa bandu abaa atsungwire ku Yesu, niabanamubwira mbu: «Nyoko, na baala benyu, na bali benyu bali ha mbuwa abakuxonda.»<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Inde ye mali na bonde bo baala betu?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Inyuma kwaho, nianasindera abandu bobabaa bamutsungwireko neneena mbu: «Mali na baala betu ni bobaikere hano. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Kubwishi kintsi mundu yakola nga ko Ongo ashashire, uyo, ye muala wetu, ye mwali wetu, ye na mali.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa mubibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu nianaxuba itangira iiyisa kwa musike wa ngetsi ye Ngalilaya. Mubuanano munene wa bandu nianamutsungulako. Kubwishi bwekyo, nianaurukira mu bwato bobwabaa buli kwa ngetsi, na bandu baimana kwa musike wa ngetsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yesu nianaiyisabo binwa bingi mu mishinga. Nianabwirabo mbu: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Muumpfe! Lwire luuma, mundu muuma nianaya ibiba mbuto mwa ixwa liwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Abere ali yabiba asambuto ito, mbuto siuma sitoera kwa musike wa nchira, asanyonyi sihika nelyato. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Na Sindi sitoera hohali mabale, hohatali mutaka mungi. Asambuto ito sixuka chuba, kubwishi habaa hatali mutaka mungi, <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />wetuwe aretsuba rabere rakola, niasinauma kubwishi amilya yato ni itasimikire mwa mutaka. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Na sindi sitoera mu mahwa. Amahwa ayo maxuka nepfundeeretsato, nato sifundwa ihetako bipfuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Wetuwe sindi mbuto sitoera ku mutaka wa buinu. Sixuka, nehetako bipfuma, siuma sihetako makumi ashatu, sindi sihetako kiratu, na sindi iyana.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu niananeena mbu: «Yawete matwi meumpfa, aumpfe!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aiyisa mu mishinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu abere ali yewene, abemitsa bewe ikumi na babiri, kuuma na mubuanano wa bandu wabaa ali hofi naye niabanamubutsa mbu aanulirebo ku amishinga iyo ibwire. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Imwe muherwe xumo yaremenya abinwa byo bibishirwe bya Bwami bwa Ongo, wetuwe abandi bandu bobatali kuuma nemwe, abaumpfa abinwa byoshe byoniiyisabo mu mishinga, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />kwebula mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‹Beresindera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">wetuwe baterelola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">berehulikya, wetuwe batereumpfa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">kwebula mbu batabindukiraa Ongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">neshashirwa.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">neshashirwa. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 6:9-10. </char></note>»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aanulira amushinga wa mubibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Niyo Yesu abwirabo kandi mbu: «Muli mutamenyire amushinga uyu, ni mukamenya aindi mishinga mute? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Amubibi anabiba Kinwa kya Ongo. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Bandu bauma banaikiritsa aKinwa ikyo ngakuno kwa sambuto sosatoeraa kwa musike wa nchira, wetuwe bamekinda iumpfakyo, Shitani ni ahika ni atengya kyokyabyalwaa mubo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Amutaka wa mabale, ha sambuto satoeraa, hashushene na bandu bobanaumpfa aKinwa kya Ongo, ni baikiritsakyo mu lumoo. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Wetuwe ni kitibe na milya mwa miete yabo, ni baikiritsakyo mu kashangi kake. Mwa kashangi aminubo na myereko yahikirabo kubwishi bwa Kinwa kya Ongo, ni basiakyo chuba. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Amutaka wa mahwa, ha sambuto satoeraa, hashushanyibwe na bobanaumpfa aKinwa kya Ongo, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />wetuwe aminubo ya kianiro kino, na rexumira abitwe, na tundi tulabwa twalwawelwawe twameingira mwa mitima yabo, ni twapfundeeretsa aKinwa ikyo kyokiri mwa myete yabo, nehangirakyo kwehetako bipfuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Na mutaka wa buinu, wa byalwaamo asambuto, ashushanyibwe na bandu bobanaumpfa aKinwa kya Ongo, neikiritsakyo. Nabo ni baba na bipfuma. Bauma bipfuma makumi ashatu, na bandi kiratu, na bandi iyana.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa retala na nengo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Inyuma kwaho Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mbeni banawakya itala kwepfunikiraro mu kitonga neri kwehiraro mweshishi wa ngyingo! Mbeni batahanikaro ku kahango! <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Batyoho, hatali kyoshekyoshe kyokibishirwe, kyokitendemenyibwa, neri hate nama yosheyoshe yoitendexwikulwa kyenene. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Yawete matwi meumpfa, aumpfe!»<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu nianaxuba ibwirabo mbu: «Munerekohya kushe kwa binwa byomuhulikya! Ongo endebalengera mwa nengo yomunerelengeramo abandi bandu, neongerera kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Kubwishi yawete ku kindu endeongererwa kindi, wetuwe yatawete ku kindu, endenyawa na kairembire iba nako.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga wa mbuto sosiixukira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu niananeena kandi mbu: «Talola kwa Bwami bwa Ongo bushushene na mundu muuma yabyalaa mbuto mwexwa liwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Kintsi lwire abaa anereonchira, nesisimuka. Na mwa kashangi umo asambuto ni serexuka neera, wetuwe ateremenya kwa sambuto asixuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Amutaka wonawene waxukya amyaka, abiti kasa, inyuma kwaho abikumba na ngano yoyiera kwa bikumba. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mwa mango angano yaera, amundu ni aya ichayo kubwishi ni kianiro kyeshayo.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa kaheke ka haratali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu nianaxuba ineena mbu: «Tushushanye aBwami bwa Ongo naki? Neri tulinganyebo na uhe mushinga? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Bushushire kaheke ka haratali. Kanaira kaxolekwa, ni kaheke kake kutsibu ilengya asindi mbeke soshe sa kwa kihuo. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Wetuwe kameotola ixolekwa, ni kaheta kutsibu ilengya asindi mbuto soshe. Ni kwaba na ndabi nyingi, sinabe na sanyonyi sa mwa kyanya ni sahika nehimba asanyutu sato mwa kipfutsa kya sandabi sao.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu abaa ereiyisa abandu mu mishinga mingi, ngakuno kwa abandu abaumpfa. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ataneenaa nabo butsira mushinga, wetuwe mwa mango ali kuuma na bemitsa bewe bonabene, ni ereanulirabo abindu byoshe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atsitsa amuhusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Lwabere lwahara luoloolo lwa lwire ulo, Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Tushabukire kwa undi mushirya wa ngetsi.»<verse eid="MRK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Abemitsa niabanalaa amubuanano wa bandu, niabaurukira mwa bwato bo Yesu abaa alimo, neenda kuuma naye. Na mandi mato mamukulikira. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Muhusi mutsibu nianatangira kwa ngetsi, amechi niamanaiumanga mwa bwato, na bwato niabunatangira iuchula mechi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Wetuwe Yesu ni aonchire ira nyuma wa bwato ni asheemere ku musheemero. Abemitsa bewe niabanamusisimula nemubwira mbu: «Mwiyisa, utalaire kwepfa retu?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu nianasisimuka, nianakemera amuhusi nebwira angetsi mbu: «Tsira! Hehera!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:39">Amuhusi nianatsira, niakunaba muhehero. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Inyuma kwaho Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Amuubaha kubwishi bwaki? Mutatsamwaba na bwimire ihikira tsene?»<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Wetuwe niabanaubaha kutsibu, niabanatangira ibutsabutsanya mbu: «Munduki uyu, anabe na muhusi na ngetsi abimuumpfira?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mundu wa bixwatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanahika kwa undi mwishirya wa ngetsi ye Ngalilaya, mwa kihuo kya Bakerasi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abandu bo balukwa «Bakerasi» hano, Matayo alukabo mbu «Baketari» Soma Matayo 8:28.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu abere atenga mwa bwato, mo kashangi umo, mundu muuma yabaa atenga kwa masinda ni aundirwe na bixwatsi, nianakorana naye. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Amundu uyo abaa anaikala kwa masinda, ni hataba na mundu woshewoshe yabaa angakocha imumina mu bulebule. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ngendo nyingi amilundi yiwe yabaa inasibikwa mu byuma, na saminwe siwe mu bulebule. Wetuwe ni erechichanga amabulebule na byuma ibyo. Habaa hataba na mundu woshewoshe yabaa angamukocha. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Akashangi koshe, kiro na mwishi, abaa anatubatuba kwa masinda na kwa bitwa ni erelaka kutsibu neibabatsanga mu mabale. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Abere axunga Yesu hale kwiye, nianaihuta neshinga amapfi mwa mbere siwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />nelaka kutsibu mbu: «Yesu Muala wa Ongo Nina mu Mbingu, aunixondakoki? Anikuhema, mwetsina ra Ongo, utaninubyaa!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Akixwatsi kyaneenaa kityo kubwishi Yesu abaa akemerakyo mbu: «We kixwatsi, tenga mwa mundu uyu!»<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu nianabutsakyo mbu: «Aretsina rawe wende?» Niakinamuxubyitsa mbu: «Aretsina rani ngye Kichiri, kubwishi itwe tuli bangi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Akixwatsi niakinaitondoola ku Yesu mbu atahentsaabyo mwa kihuo umo.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Aho, hofi na kitwa, habaa kihyo kinene kya ngulube ni asikererako. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Abixwatsi niabinaitondoola ku Yesu mbu: «Utulike tuingire mwa ngulube siraa.» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu nianabwirabyo mbu muende! Abixwatsi niabinatenga mwa mundu uyo, neingira mwa ngulube. Akihyo kyoshe kya sangulube kyabaa akishembashemba bihumbi bibiri niakinatenga kwa kitwa neiuma mwa ngetsi, nato niasinatsika.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Abasumba ba sangulube ito niabanalibita chuba mwa mulungu na mwa bihya ipfula amwatsi. Abandu niabanahika kwebula mbu baxunge ku byobyametsuka. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Babere bamehika hofi ne Yesu, niabanaxunga amundu yabaa aundirwe na bixwatsi ni aikere, ni aimbere kushe, ni amefulukya abwenge buwe. Niabanaubaha. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Bobaxungaa ku byobyametsuka, niabanapfulirao abandu byobyahikiraa amundu yabaa aundirwe na bixwatsi na byobyahikiraa asangulube.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Niyo abandu batangira iitondoola ku Yesu mbu atenge mwa kihuo kyabo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu abere ali yaurukira mwa bwato, amundu yabaa aundirwe na bixwatsi nianaitondoola kuye mbu aende kuuma naye. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Wetuwe Yesu atamutsiyira. Nianamubwira mbu: «Enda kwa wenyu, mwa kipfunga kyawe, pfulirabo abyoshe byo Ninakuwetu amekukolera na kwakupfiraa bwoncho.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Amundu uyo nianaenda, nianatangira ipfula abyoshe byo Yesu amukoleraa mwa kihuo kye «Ndekapoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ndekapoli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni bula mbu kihuo kya milungu ikumi.</char></note>». Na bandu boshe bobamuxungaa niabanashishala kutsibu.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mwali wa Yairo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu nianashabuka kwa undi mushirya wa ngetsi ye Ngalilaya mu bwato. Abere ali kwa musike wa ngetsi, bandu bangi niabanabuanana hofi naye. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Mukulukulu muuma wa mwa hekalu yalukwa mbu ye Yairo nianahika. Abere axunga ku Yesu nianapfukama mwa mbere siwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Nianaitondoola kuye mbu: «Mwali wani mulere ali ku lwepfa. Anikuhema uwiche kasa, umuhireko asaminwe sawe, nge alama nebaho!»<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu nianaenda kuuma naye. Mubuanano wa bandu bangi nianamukulikira nemupfundeeretsa. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Na mubo ni muli mukatsi muuma ni amebanda myaka ikumi nebiri ni alwere bukoni bwehetsa shiama. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Amukatsi uyu abaa amenuba kutsibu kweendera banganga bangi nehetsa bitwe bingi. Wetuwe atakocha ilama, na bukoni buiongerera kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Amukatsi uyo abere ameumpfa amwatsi kuluenda Yesu, nianaingira mwa kati ka mubuanano wa bandu ira nyuma ku Yesu, nepfula kwa lukimba luwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />kubwishi abaa ereibubukya mbu: «Nikenepfulaho kwa lukimba lwa Yesu, ni nikalama.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Abere anapfulaho kwa lukimba lwa Yesu, mo kashangi umoho, abukoni buwe bwa rehetsa ashiama niabunachikira, nianaiumpfa mwa mubiri uwe kwamelama. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Na mo kashangi umoho, Yesu nianakengula kwa maala mewe mamekola mulimo. Nianakebera mwa kati ka mubuanano nebutsa mbu: «Inde yamepfula kwa lukimba lwani?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Abemitsa bewe niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Utatsene kwa bandu abakupfundeeretsa? Ungabutsa ute kwinde yamekupfulako?»<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Wetuwe Yesu nianalola kwa minda yoshe kwebula mbu axunge ku yashamupfulako. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Amukatsi uyo nianaubaha netangira ititimana, kubwishi ni amekengula abyoshe byobyamemuhikira. Niyo ahika nepfukama mwa mbere sa Yesu nemubwira akuli yoshe. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Mwali wani, abwimire bwawe bwamekulamya. Iendere mu buholo, abukoni bwawe bwamelama.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu abere atatsakinda ineena abinwa ibyo, bandu bauma niabanahika ni abatenga ira mwa Yairo amukulukulu wa sinakoki, neneena mbu: «Mwali wawe amepfa, utakinubyaa amwiyisa.» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Wetuwe Yesu atalaa kwa binwa uko, nianabwira amukulukulu wa sinakoki uyo mbu: «Utaubahaa, unaimiriraeho.»<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu atatsiya mbu mundu woshewoshe amuhereketse, ali ate Petero, ne Yakobo, ne Yohana, muala wabo Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Babere bahika ha mwa Yairo, Yesu nianashinganaho burunga bungi, abandu ni abalira nelaka kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Nianaingira mwa nyumba nebwirabo mbu: «Amuira burunga bungi nelira kubwishi bwaki? Amwananyere uyu atapfire, wetuwe anaonchireho!» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Niabanatangira imushekenyula. Niyo Yesu ahulukya abandu boshe ha mbuwa, nianatsimba ababuti ba mwananyere uyo kuuma na bemitsa bewe bashatu, niabanaingira mwa kyumba kya mwananyere abaa alimo. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu nianatsimba amwananyere kwa kuboko, nianamubwira mbu: «Talita kumu, ni bula mbu: ‹Mwananyere, anikubwira mbu batuka!›»<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Mo kashangi umoho, amwananyere nianabatuka netangira iiendera. Abaa na miaka ikumi nebiri. Abandu niabanashishala kwexunga kwa kinwa ikyo. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Wetuwe Yesu nianahangirabo mbu batapfulirao mundu woshewoshe. Inyuma kwaho nianabwirabo mbu bahe amwananyere uyo yo bilyo.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Becha i Nasareti batinda iimirira Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Niyo Yesu atenga iyo, nianaya mwa mulungu uwe wauxukiraamo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mulungu uwe wa uxukiraamo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">i Nasareti. Matayo 13:54; Luka 4:16.</char></note>. Na bemitsa bewe nabo niabanamukulikira. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Alwire lwa Sabato lwabere lwaeraho, nianatangira iiyisa mwa sinakoki. Bandu bangi niabanamuumpfiritsa, niabanashishala kutsibu, niabanabutsabutsanya mbu: «Uyu atengyitse abinwa byoshe ibi hai? Buteateanya buli bute ubu bwa habwaa? Mu maalaki mwakola atushingishiro tuli ngakuno utu?» <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Mbeni uyu ate amuseremara, muala wa Mariya, mualabo Yakobo, ne Yose, ne Yuta ne Simoni! Na bali babo, mbeni batali mwa kati ketu! Na kubwishi bwekyo batakocha imwimirira. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Amutahwa anapfibwa xoni ahoshe hakatsuka, wetuwe kwawaboho, mwa kati ka banyakyabo, na mwa kipfunga kiweho mwatanapfibwa xoni.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Kubwishi bwekyo Yesu atakocha ikola kashingishiro koshekoshe iyo, liri lite aretereka asaminwe siwe ku bakoni bauma nelamyabo. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Naye nianashishala kutsibu kubwishi bwaretinda iimirira ra bandu abo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu alika abemitsa bewe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-16">Luk 9:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianatamba mwa mitsi ya mwa mbambambamba se Nasareti, ni aiyisa abandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Nianabirangira abemitsa bewe ikumi na babiri, nianatangira ilikabo babiri babiri, nehabo maala mehentsa abixwatsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Nianakalihyabo mbu: «Mwa luendo lwenyu, mutereheka kindu kyoshekyoshe iri ite ngóma ho. Mutereheka mbikya, neri shaho, neri faranga mwa mikoba yenyu. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Munereimbala bilyato, wetuwe ni mutiimbale ngimba ibiri.» <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Kintsi hobakenderebakokera mwa manyumba, ni mwaikalamo ihikira homukendetengera iyo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Na kintsi ha bandu benderetinda ibakokera nebaumpfira, ni mwatenga aho, nekunguta amupfupfu wa kwa bishando byenyu. Akinwa ikyo kyendeba kaliho kubo.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Niyo abemitsa baenda, ni abahubiri abandu mbu bahingye amiberere yabo mibi. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Niabanahentsa bixwatsi bingi, niabanahaka mapfuta ku bakoni bangi nelamyabo.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abandu abaibutsiritsa ngakuno Yesu yende</para>
  <para style="s">(Mat 14:1-12; Luk 9:7-9)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Mwami Herote nianaumpfa amwatsi wa Yesu, kubwishi aretsina liwe ni liire ngulu ahoshe. Bandu bauma berebula mbu: «Uyu ye Yohana Murubiki yamepfuka! Kyokituma aba na maala mekola tushingishiro.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Wetuwe abandi berebula mbu: «Uyu ye mutahwa Eliya.» Na bandi mbu: «Iye mutahwa ngakuno muuma wa batahwa ba kwa mira.»<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana achibwa amutwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:3-12">Mat 14:3-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Wetuwe Herote abere aumpfa amyatsi iyo, nianabula mbu: «Yohana Murubiki yonabulaa mbu achibwe amutwe yamepfuka!» <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Herote yewene yakalihyaa mbu Yohana atsimbwe abe nehirwa mwa nyumba ya muliki. Lwabaa lutyo kubwishi Herote ni amehikya Herotiya, muka Firipo, muala wabo. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yohana abaa ni amebwira Herote ku atalirene ihikya muka muala wabo.<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Kubwishi bwekyo Herotiya nianabikira Yohana yo muxona nexonda imwita, wetuwe atakocha kubwishi bwa Herote. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Herote abaa aubahire Yohana, kubwishi ni echi ku Yohana mundu atunganene na kandi mundu akomire. Kubwishi bwekyo nianamulanga. Abaa atsiyire imuhulikya, na kiro mbu abaa anairirikana kutsibu ali aumpfa kwashambala naye.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Lwire luuma Herotiya nianabonekya nchira yeita Yohana. Na nchira iyo yabaa ni areubuka alwire lwa rebutwa ra Herote, mwa mango akolaa alinye ali yalalika abemanitsi ba mirimo ya kihuo, na bakulukulu ba basura na bakulukulu be Ngalilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mwali wa Herotiya nianaingira mwa nyumba ya linye. Nianatsina ihikira luero lwemoya Herote na bobalalikwaa. Niyo mwami Herote abwira amwananyere uyo mbu: «Uniheme kindu kyoshekyoshe kyouxonda, nani nikakuhakyo.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Inyuma kwaho nianalahitsa mbu: «Nikakuha kindu kyoshekyoshe kyoukanihema, na kiro kyaba na kiche kya kwa bwami bwani.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Amwananyere uyo, nianahuluka neya ibutsa nina mbu: «Nihemeki?» Nina nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Hema amutwe wa Yohana Murubiki.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mu kashalimo amwananyere uyo, nianafuluka chuba mwa mbere sa mwami nemuhema mbu: «Anixonda mbu unihe tsenetsene amutwe wa Yohana Murubiki kwa mbale kuno.»<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Amwami nianayongwa kutsibu. Wetuwe kubwishi bwarelahitsa liwe mwa mbere sa bandu balalikaa, ni atangakimutindira. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Niyo amwami alika muuma mwa basura balangi bewe nemubwira mbu aende alete amutwe wa Yohana Murubiki. Amusura nianaenda mwa nyumba ya muliki kwecha amutwe wa Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Nianaletao ku mbale. Nianahao amwananyere uyo, naye nianahao nina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Mwa mango abemitsa ba Yohana baumpfaa amwatsi uyo, niabanaya ibinga andundwe ya Yohana netayo mu isinda.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auutya balume bihumbi bitano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Mwa mango asandumwa safulukaa ho Yesu ali, niasinamutondoolera abinwa byoshe byobakolaa na byoshe byobaiyisaa. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Abandu bobabaa abawicha na bobaenda babaa bangi kutsibu, anabe iye na bemitsa bewe bataata kashangi kelya. Kubwishi bwekyo nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Twenabene tuende ho hatali bandu nge mwatamuka kake.» <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Niabanaenda bonabene mwa bwato hohatali bandu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Wetuwe bandu bangi bobaxungaabo kwabaenda, niabanamenyabo. Kubatyo abandu niabanatenga mwa mitsi yoshe mu bishando, niabanaxondolerabo yobabaa abaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu abere atenga mwa bwato, nianaxunga mubuanano munene wa bandu, nianapfirabo bwoncho, kubwishi ni bali ngakuno mbuli sitawete musumba. Ni yatangira iiyisabo binwa bingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />lwabere lwahara luoloolo, abemitsa ba Yesu niabanamuhikira nemubwira mbu: «Hano bweru, na tsene lwahara luoloolo. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Laa abandu aba nge baya iiulira bilyo mwa bihya na mwa mitsi ya mwa misike.»<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Imwe mwenabene muhebo bilyo.» Wetuwe niabanamubutsa mbu: «Auxonda mbu tuende yatuule mikati ya tinari maana mabiri nge twahabo balye?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abichere ibi, abilukwa mbu: «Tinari». Atinari lwabaa lufaranga lwepfuha mundu yamekola mubitsi muuma. Ni bula mbu amaana mabiri ma safaranga ito, sabaa faranga nyingi kutsibu.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Muwete ku mikati ingahe? Mutange mwa lola kasa.» Babere bameotola imenya ko ingana, niabanamubwira mbu: «Tunaweteho ku mikati itano na fi ibiri.»<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Niyo Yesu akalihya abemitsa bewe mbu babwire abandu baikale kwa biti hashi mu bitumo bya lwawelwawe. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Niabanaikala mu bitumo bya bandu iana iana, na makumi atano atano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianatsimba amikati itano iyo na safi ibiri, nianalalamira mu mbingu, nianasima Ongo. Nianacha mwa mikati iyo, nianahayo abemitsa bewe kuuma na safi ibiri kweabirato kwa bandu boshe. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Aboshe niabanalya newuuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Inyuma kwaho, abemitsa niabanatololera abiche bya mikati na bya safi byobafundwaa, bauchutsa bitonga ikumi na bibiri. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Amuancho wa balume bobalyaaho kwa bilyo, abaa bihumbi bitano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atandaira kwa mechi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Mo kashangi umoho, Yesu nianakalihya abemitsa bewe mbu bauruke mwa bwato, nemuxondolera kwa undi mwishirya wa ngetsi ye Ngalilaya, kweerekera amulungu we Betesaita. Mo kishangi umo ashibaa ni alaa amubuanano wa bandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Abere amelaabo nianaya ihema kwa kitwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Bwabere bwahara buoloba, abwato bwabaa mwa kati ka ngetsi, ne Yesu ni ashibire yewene kwa musike wa ngetsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Nianaxunga ko abemitsa bewe abapfuama mu minubo kubwishi amuhusi nierefulukyabo ira nyuma. Bwabere bwaxonda ikya, Yesu nianakulikirabo ni atandaira kwa mechi ma ngetsi, abaa axonda italukabo. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Nabo babere bamuxunga ali yatandaira kwa mechi ma ngetsi, niabanaanikira mbu mutsimu. Niabanatangira ilaka, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />kubwishi aboshe bamuxungaa, neubaha kutsibu. Wetuwe mo kashangi umoho, Yesu niananeena nabo mbu: «Muisimikiritse, ingye uno! Mutaubahaa!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Inyuma kwaho nianauruka mwa bwato bobabaamo, na muhusi nianachikira. Kwikyo, abemitsa niabanashishala kutsibu, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kubwishi batamenyaa kwakashingishiro ka mikati kabwire, kureba amyete yabo yabaa mitsibu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya bakoni bangi i Ngenesareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Babere bashabuka angetsi, niabanahika mwa kihuo kye Ngenesareti, niabanasheeka abwato kwa musike wa ngetsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Babere batenga mwa bwato, mu kashalimo abandu niabanakengula Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Niabanaenda chuba, ni abatsuka mwa kihuo kyoshe ikyo, niabanatangira imuletera abakoni, ni bahetwe ku mindara, niabanaendera Yesu ahoshe hobaumpfaa ku hali. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Na kintsi ho Yesu ayaa, mwa milungu, na mwa mitsi, neri mwa bihya, abandu berehira abakoni mwa mbua sa mibuanano, neitondoola kwiye mbu alikebo bapfule kwa mupfungo wa lukimba luwe. Na boshe bobapfulaa kulo balamaa.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na ndungo ya Bayahuti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />aBafarisayo na baandiki bauma ba Muomba bobatengaa i Yerusalemu, niabanabuanana mwa mbere sa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Niabanaxunga ku bauma mwa bemitsa ba Yesu ni abalya bilyo mu minwe sihalire, rebula mbu ilya butsira ikaraba kwa minwe kwekulikira adungo yabo. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Lwabaa lutyo, kubwishi aBafarisayo na Bayahuti boshe ni banakulikira andungo ya boshekulitsa, yoihangire ilya butsira ikaraba kushe kwa minwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Na kandi, mwa mango batenga mweuliro, batangalya butsira ikaraba. Na kalengyo abakulikira na sindi ndungo nyingi, ngakuno arexua abiriko, na bibindi, na sanyungu sosikolirwe mu miringa, na sangyingo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">na sangyingo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bitabo bingi bitaahwire angingo.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Tsene, aBafarisayo na beisa ba Muomba niabanabutsa Yesu mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki abemitsa bawe, ibo batabakulikira andungo ya botatakulitsa? Kubwishi abalya bilyo mu minwe sihalire!» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Isaya airaa kushe ali yakola abutahwa, mwa mango aandikaa abinwa ibi, kuluenda mwa boshetulimi tubiri imwe ku Ongo aneena mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‹Abandu aba bananipfa xoni kwa mitutu yaboho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">wetuwe amyete yabo ni iri hale nani.›»<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Areniimanikira ronimuimanikira ra busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">kubwishi ameyiso mobaiyisa abandu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">mateeko ma kolirwe na bandu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 29:13.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Muneresiika amateeko ma Ongo, ni mwatsimba kwa ndungo sa bandu.» <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Mwichi kushe itinda amateeko ma Ongo kwebula mbu mutsimbe kwa ndungo senyu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Kubwishi Musa aneenaa mbu: «Unerepfa ixo ne nyoko bo xoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 20:12. </char></note>, na yakakamba ishe neri nina, ni alirene iitwa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 21:17. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Wetuwe imwe munerebula mbu amundu akeba na kindu kyeasikya ishe neri nina, akemubwira mbu akindu ikyo Korobane, rebula mbu kyametulwa Ongo kweba mutulo akomire, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />ni mwamuha rubu mbu ataasikyaa ababuti bewe. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Komuneresuntsuura mutyo aKinwa kya Ongo kubwishi bwa ndungo yenyu yamuneresiirana. Amukola bindi binwa bingi biri ngebyo.<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abinwa byobihatsa amundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu nianaxuba ibirangira amubuanano wa bandu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mwe boshe munihulikye, mube neumpfa kushe abinwa ibi. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Hatali kindu kyokinaingira mwa mundu kiri akitenga ira mbua, kyokingakocha imuhatsa. Wetuwe akindu kyokitenga mwa mundu, kyokinamuhatsa. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Amundu yali na matwi meumpfa, aumpfe.»<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Mwa mango Yesu asiyaa amubuanano neingira mwa nyumba, abemitsa bewe niabanamubutsa kwa mushinga uyo abwire. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Naye nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Munabe nemwe mutatsamwanaumpfa neki? Mutanechi ku kintsi kindu kyokiingira mwa mundu kiri akitenga ira mbua kitangakocha imuhatsa? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Kubwishi akindu ikyo kitakiingira mwa mwete uwe, wetuwe akiingiraho mwa bula nenyuma waho ni kyahuluka neya mwa bwiya.» Yesu abere aneenatyo, abwerekyaa kwa bilyo byoshe bikomire kwelibwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesu niananeena kandi mbu: «Akindu kyokitenga mwa kati ka mundu kyokinamuhatsa. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kubwishi mwa kati ka mundu, mwa mwete uwe momunatenga amianikire mibi yoinaleta: abuingo bubi, na bwitsi, na bwiti, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />na lusingi, na kalabwa kabi, na buiniini, na bitingo, na micho mibi, na lui, na lukambo, na kingami, na butiritiri. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Abubi bwoshe ubo abutenga mwa kati ka mundu, nabo bobunamuhatsa.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abwimire bwa mukatsi Mukiriki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Niyo Yesu atenga aho, neya mwa kyango kyokiri hofi na mulungu we Tiro. Iyo, nianaingira mu nyumba mu bubixo, abaa ataxonda mbu bamenye kwali umo. Wetuwe litakocheka mbu aibishe. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Mukatsi muuma, mwali ni aundirwe na bixwatsi, nianaumpfa amwatsi wa Yesu. Nianahika neyiuma mwa bishando bya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Amukatsi uyo atabaa muyahuti, abaa mu Kiriki, mwicha mwa kyango kye Suriya. Nianahema Yesu mbu ahentse akixwatsi ikyo kitenge mu mwali. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Wetuwe Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Siya kasa abana ba nyumba batangebauuta, kubwishi litalirene kwetsimba abilyo bya bana nekabulabyo asambwa.»<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Amukatsi uyo nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, auneena kuli. Wetuwe sinabe na sambwa sinalya bya bana baneretoyangya kwa mesa.»<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Kubwishi bwa muxubyo uyo, uhara ungafuluka hamwawe, akixwatsi kyametenga mu mwali wawe.»<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Amukatsi uyo abere ahika mwamwe, nianashingana mwali ni aonchire kwa ngyingo, na kixwatsi ikyo ni kyamemutengamo.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya amutwitwi kandi ni mutepfutepfu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Inyuma kwaho Yesu nianatenga mwa kyango kyo kiri hofi ne Tiro, nianatsuka i Sitona na hakatikati ka kyango kye Ndekapoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ndekapoli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mariko 5:20, na shonchomotsi ya kinwa Ndekapoli.</char></note>, abanehika kwa ngetsi ye Ngalilaya. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Niabanamuletera mundu yabaa mutwitwi kandi ni mutepfutepfu. Bobaletaa amundu uyo niabanaitondoola ku Yesu mbu amulamye kwemuhirako asaminwe siwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu nianaisiika naye hale na mubuanano, nianamuhira amyolota mwa matwi, nianachira mate, nemupfulako kwa lulimi mwa mate mewe yenawene. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Inyuma kwaho Yesu nianalalamira mu mbingu, nianahumula nebwira amundu uyo mbu: «Efata», rebula mbu: «Tsibukala!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Mu kashalimo, amatwi mewe niamanatsibukala, na lulimi luwe nalo luiyobola, nianatangira ineena kushe. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu nianateekabo mbu batabwiraa mundu woshewoshe amwatsi wa kinwa iki. Wetuwe kwahangiraabo mbu batapfuliraao mundu woshewoshe, kwa mwatsi anayaa ngulu neshanchana mwa bandu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Abandu niabanashishala kutsibu mbu: «Abinwa byakola bikwirire kutsibu. Atuma na batwitwi baumpfa, na batepfutepfu ni baneena kushe.»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu auutya bandu bihumbi bine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mo biro umo bandu bangi niabanabuanana kandi. Nabo babere bamehusha kyo balya, Yesu nianabirangira abemitsa bewe, nianabwirabo mbu: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Anipfira abandu aba bo bwoncho, kubwishi tsene biro bishatu bino ni banali kuuma nani, nabo batakiwete ku bilyo. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nani nikebwirabo mbu bafuluke yobatengaa butsira ilya ni bakatetera mwa nchira, kubwishi bauma mubo shabatenga hale.»<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Abemitsa bewe niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Waliha! Mundu angakocha itengya bilyo hai byeuutya abandu aba mwa bweru muno?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Muwete ku mikati ingahe?» Nabo niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Tuwete ku mikati irinda.»<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yesu nianakalihya abandu mbu baikale hashi. Nianatsimba amikati irinda iyo, nianasima Ongo, nianacha muyo, nianahayo abemitsa bewe mbu baabireyo kwa bandu. Na bemitsa niabanaabirayo kwa bandu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Babaa bawete na ku twafi. Yesu nianaashanira atwafi uto, nebwira abemitsa mbu baabeto. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Aboshe niabanalya newuuta. Niabanatololera abiche bya mikati byoshabishiba, niabanauchutsa bitonga birinda. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Abandu bobalyaa kwa bilyo uko, babaa balume abashembashemba bihumbi bine. Abere amelaabo, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />nianauruka mu bwato kuuma na bemitsa bewe, nianaya mwa kyango kye Ndalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBafarisayo abaxonda kalolero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />aBafarisayo niabanahikira Yesu baba netangira ikubirisanya naye. Niabanamuereka kwemuhema mbu abwerekyebo kalolero kokabereretsa kwa maala mewe amatenga mu mbingu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu nianaikya mbumu kutsibu mu buyongwa mwa mwete uwe mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki mo bandu balubuto luno amuxonda mbu muxunge ku kalolero? Anibabwira mwa kuli, mutibwerekyibwe kalolero!»<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Inyuma kwaho, nianasiyabo, nianauruka kandi mu bwato, neshabuka angetsi.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achachu ya Bafarisayo na ya Herote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Abemitsa babaa ni bameibirira iheka mikati, banabaa na mukati muumaho mwa bwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu nianateekabo mbu: «Munakohya kutsibu, munerekenga achachu ya Bafarisayo na ya Herote.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Abemitsa niabanatangira ibutsabutsanya mbu: «Aneenatyo kubwishi tutawete ku mikati.»<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu nianakengula abinwa byoshabaneena, niyo abutsabo mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amushambala kuluenda arehusha amikati? Mutanatsamwamenya neri iumpfa? Amyete yenyu ikinali mitsibu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Muli na mesha, wetuwe mutamulola? Muli na matwi, wetuwe mutamuumpfa? Mutaubukire, <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />mwa mango nachaa mwa mikati itano, niha bandu bihumbi bitano bilyo? Mwa mango umo mwauchutsaa bitonga bingahe byabicheche bya mikati?» Niabanaxubya mbu: «Ikumi na bibiri.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Naye nianabutsabo kandi mbu: «Na mwa mango nachaa mwa mikati irinda nihayo bandu bihumbi bine balyayo, mwauchutsaa bitonga bingahe byamisialitsa?» Niabanaxubya mbu: «Birinda.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Nehika tsene, mutanatsamwaumpfa kindu kyoshekyoshe?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahumula amesha ma kihumahumi i Betesaita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanahika i Betesaita. Iyo niabanaletera Yesu yo mundu muuma kihumahumi, nehema Yesu mbu amupfuleko nge akocha ilola. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu nianatsimba kwa kuboko ra kihumahumi ikyo nemutwala ira mbua ya mutsi. Yesu abere ameotola ihaka mate kwa mesha ma mundu uyo nemuhirako asaminwe, nianamubutsa mbu: «Utsene ku kindu?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Akihumahumi niakinabatula amesha mewe nebula mbu: «Nitsene ku bandu, nitsene kubo nga miti, wetuwe abaenda.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu nianapfula kandi kwa mesha ma kihumahumi ikyo, nakyo niakinalola kushe. Amesha mewe niamanahumukala, aba nelola kwa bindu byoshe kyenene. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianamubwira mbu afuluke mwamwe, wetuwe ataingiraa mwa mulungu.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero abwerekya ku Yesu ye Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanaya kwa munda wa mitsi yo iri hofi na mulungu we Kaisariya Firipi. Mwa nchira umo, Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Abandu aberebula kwingye ngye inde?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Nabo niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Bauma aberebula kwiwe we Yohana Murubiki, na bandi aberebula kwiwe we mutahwa Eliya, na bandi aberebula ku uli muuma wa mwa batahwa.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Niyo Yesu abutsabo mbu: «Nemwe amwerebula kwingye, ngye inde?» Petero nianaxubya mbu: «Iwe we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu nianateekabo ku batendebwira mundu woshewoshe akinwa ikyo.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amwatsi wa lupfu na warepfuka ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:24-28">Mat 21:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk 9:23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesu nianatangira iyisa abemitsa bewe mbu: «Muala wa Mundu alirene inuba netindwa na bemanitsi ba bandu, na boshebakungu kuuma na beisa ba Muomba. Akaitwa na mwa lwire lwa kashatu inyuma yarepfa liwe, akapfuka.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Abwiraabo abinwa ibyo kyenene. Niyo Petero abwira Yesu mbu baisiike. Petero nianatangira imukemera. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabindukira abemitsa bewe nekemeranga Petero mbu: «Ipfunde hale nani we Shitani, kubwishi amuanikire wawe ate wa Ongo, wetuwe wa mundu.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bate kotungakulira Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mat 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk 9:23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Inyuma kwaho Yesu nianabirangira amubuanano wa bandu kuuma na bemitsa bewe, nianabwirabo mbu: «Amundu ali axonda inikulikira, ni atilae kwa buingo buwe yenawene, wetuwe ni aheka amusalaba uwe nenikulikira. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kubwishi amundu yaxonda iufula abuingo buwe, akahetsabo, wetuwe yakatula abuingo buwe kubwishi bwa ingye na kubwishi bwa Mwatsi Mubuya, endeufulabo. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mbeni amundu angaba na mungurukoki akeata kwa buxoki bwoshe bwa kwa kihuo, nehetsa abuingo buwe! <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Hatali kindu kyoshekyoshe kyamundu angatula kwetongotsa abuingo buwe. <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Kubwishi bwekyo, mundu woshewoshe yanipfira xoni na yapfira ameyiso mani mo xoni mwa bandu ba lubuto luno, lolutali na mwinihiro mwa mbere sa Ongo, na loluli na ntsambi, Muala wa Mundu endemupfira xoni mwa lwire endehika mwa ngulu ya Tata kuuma na bamalaika bakomire.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu niananeena kandi na bandu abo mbu: «Mwa kuli anibabwira ku bauma mu bo bali hano, batendepfa batatsabaxunga kwa Bwami bwa Ongo buli yobuwicha mu maala.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusu bwa Yesu bwashusha kundi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-9">Mat 17:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Inyuma ya biro ndatu, Yesu nianatsimba Petero ne Yakobo, ne Yohana, nianatwalabo bonabene ku kitwa kire. Neyo abusu bwa Yesu niabunashusha kundi mwa mbere sabo. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Asangimba siwe niasinabinduka sa mweru kutsibu nebwengabwenga. Na kwa kihuo kuno kutali mundu yangafurato mbu sibe sa mweru sityo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Niyo abemitsa bashatu baxunga ku Eliya ne Musa ni abashambala ne Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petero nianabwira Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, lirirene tuikale hano. Tuhimbeho mitanda ishatu, muuma wawe, na undi wa Musa, na undi wa Eliya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petero ahusha kya neena, kubwishi iye na balikyabo ni baubahire kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Niyo akipfu kyapfumbuka kiba nexwikabo, na mulenge nianaumpfibwa ni atenga mwa kipfu ikyo mbu: «Uyu ye Muala wani Mutsiyirwa. Muneremuumpfira!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Mu kashalimo, abemitsa niabanasindera kwa minda yoshe, bataxunga ku mundu woshewoshe ali ate Yesu yenawene.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Babere bali yobakima kwa kitwa, Yesu nianakalihyabo mbu: «Mutapfuliraa mundu woshewoshe abinwa byomwamelolako ihikira arepfuka ra Muala wa Mundu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Niabanatsimba kweteeko iro, wetuwe niabanatangira ibutsabutsanya mbu: «Arepfuka iro alibula lite?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abemitsa babutsa Yesu kuluenda Eliya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Mat 17:10-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Niabanabutsa Yesu mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki abeisa ba Muomba banerebula mbu Eliya alirene iwicha kasa?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Mwa kuli Eliya alirene iwicha kasa kwetunganyanya abinwa byoshe. Wetuwe kubwishi bwaki aMaandiko Makomire amerebula mbu Muala wa Mundu endenubibwa nenenwa kutsibu? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Wetuwe anibabwira ku Eliya aotwere iwicha, na bandu bamukolera kya bwana, nga ko aMaandiko mabwire kuluenda iye.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahentsa akixwatsi mu mwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe bashatu babere bafuluka ha bandi bemitsa babaa bali, niabanaxunga ku bandu bangi ni batsungwire kubo na beisa ba Muomba ni abakubirisanya nabo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Amubuanano wa bandu abere xunga ku Yesu, nianashishala kutsibu. Mo kashangi umoho, niabanalibita kweya imuketsa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Amukubirisanya nabo kuluendaki?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Mundu muuma mwa mubuanano nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Mwiyisa, namekuletera amwana wani kubwishi alimo kixwatsi kyokituma ataneena. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Akixwatsi kinaira kyamuundira, mu kintsi kashangi, ni kyamukunula, na mwana uyo ni atengamo lufumba ni aba neshia ameno, na mubiri ni auma. Nabwiraa abemitsa bawe mbu bahentse akixwatsi ikyo, wetuwe batakocha.»<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Mwe bandu ba lubuto lwaretinda iimirira Ongo! Nikendeikala kuuma nemwe ihikira mangoki? Nikendebabeetsa ihikira mangoki? Muniletere amwana uyo hano.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Niyo bamuleteraye. Na kixwatsi kyabere kyaxunga ku Yesu, niakinahirianya amwana uyo kutsibu, nianawa hashi nealaala ni atengamo lufumba. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu nianabutsa ishe wa mwana mbu: «Ameba atya ihuluka mangoki?» Ishe wa mwana nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Ihuluka mwa bwana buwe.» <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Na ngendo nyingi akixwatsi iki kinamuuma mu muchanwa na mu mechi, kwexonda mbu kimwite. Wetuwe uli ungakocha ikola kindu, utupfire bwoncho na kandi utuasikye. <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki auneena mbu uli ungakocha? Abyoshe bikakocheka ku yaimirire.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Mu kashalimo, ishe wa mwana niananeena kutsibu mbu: «Niimirire! Wetuwe uniasikye kubwishi bwa aretinda iimirira!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Mwa mango Yesu axungaa kwa bandu abaiongerera ibuanana chubachuba, nianakemera akixwatsi mbu: «We kixwatsi wotuma amundu uyu ataneena kushe aba na mutwitwi, anikukalihya mbu tenga mwa mundu uyu, utakihirexuba ifuluka!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Akixwatsi ikyo niakinalaka mu mulenge mule, niakinahirianya amwana kutsibu, kiba nemutengamo. Amwana nianaba nga amepfa, na bandu bangi babula mbu amepfa. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Wetuwe Yesu nianamutsimba kwa minwe, nianamubatula, naye nianaimana.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu abere ameotola iingira mwa nyumba, abemitsa bewe niabanamubutsa ni bali bonabene mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki itwe tutakochaa ihentsa akixwatsi ikyo?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Bixwatsi biri ngakuno ibyo bingahentsibwa mu mahemo ho.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arepfa na repfuka ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanatenga iyo, babanetsukira mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya. Yesu abaa ataxonda mbu abandu bamenye ho bali, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kubwishi abaa aiyisa abemitsa bewe. Nianabwirabo mbu: «Muala wa Mundu akahirwa mwa minwe sa bandu, nabo bakamwita, na mwa lwire lwa kashatu inyuma ya lupfu luwe, akapfuka.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Wetuwe abemitsa batamenya kwa meyiso ayo mabwire. Niabanaubaha imubutsa kinwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amukulukulu mwa bwami bwa Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanahika i Kaperenaumu. Babere bahara mwa nyumba, Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Shamwerekubirisanya mwa nchira, kuluendaki?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Wetuwe niabanatsira, kubwishi ni shaberekubirisanya mwa nchira kuluenda inde ye mukulukulu mubo.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu nianaikala, nianabirangira abemitsa bewe ikumi na babiri nebwirabo mbu: «Amundu yaxonda iba muxondotsi alirene iihira mutsindu wa boshe neba mupfuku wa boshe.»<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Niyo atsimba mwana mulere, nianamuhira mwa mbere sabo, nenyuma wa remukokera, nianabwirabo mbu: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Yakokera mwana mulere yali nga uyu kubwishi bwa ingye, ni amenikokera ingye. Na yameniangirira, ate ingye ngyaangirira, wetuwe ni ameangirira ula yanilikaa.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yate mulenda wetu ni muuma netwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana nianabwira Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, shatuxunga ku mundu muuma ni ahentsa abixwatsi mwa itsina rawe, netwe shatumuhangira kubwishi iye ni atali wa mwa kikanga kyetu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Wetuwe Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Muteremuhangira, kubwishi hatali mundu yangakola kashingishiro mwa itsina rani, nenyuma hake ni aniahula kubi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Kolunali lutyo, kubwishi yate mulenda wetu, ni ali kwa munda wetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Na kintsi yakendebaha lungu lwa mechi kubwishi bwa ingye, kureba imwe muli bandu ba Kirisitu, anibabwira mwa kuli, amundu uyo atendefundwa ihabwa aluhembo luwe.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kohya utangechetoera mu ntsambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Kintsi yakendetuma muuma wa mwa bake bobaniimirire aba atoera mu ntsambi, ni shalingakwirire kwiye aminwe lushyo lunene mweosi nekabulwa mwa nyancha. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Aminwe yawe iketuma ukola ntsambi, ni wachayo! Ni likwirire kwiwe kweingira mwa buingo bwa kuli ni uli na minwe nguma, ilengya iya na saminwe ibiri i ku tsimu, mo mutatsima muchanwa kiro na hake. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Umo munaba mipfunyu yoitapfa, na muchanwa watatsima. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Akishando kyawe ni kingaba kiketuma ukola ntsambi, ni wachakyo. Kubwishi ni likwirire kwiwe kweingira mwa buingo bwa kuli ni uli na kishando kiuma, kwebula mbu uingire na bishando bibiri i kutsimu. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Umo munaba mipfunyu yoitapfa, na muchanwa watatsima. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Alisha rawe liri lingatuma ukola ntsambi, ni wakularo. Kubwishi ni likwirire kwiwe kweingira mwa bwami bwa Ongo ni uli na lisha liuma, ilengya iba na mesha mabiri nelekerwa i kutsimu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Umo muli mipfunyu yoitapfa, na muchanwa watatsima.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Abandu boshe bendetsuka mu muchanwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa mango aBayahuti babaa banaletera Ongo amitulo, babaa banahakayo munyu. Soma Balawi 2:13.</char></note> wa minubo nehakwa munyu we komibwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Amunyu kindu kibuya. Wetuwe amunyu akehetsa abuloke bwao, ni mungahirwaki kandi kwebula mbu atwe? Munereba na munyu mwimwe, neba na buholo mwa kati kenyu.<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Meyiso ma Yesu kuluenda aresiyana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu nianatenga iyo, ninaya mwa kyango kye Yuteya neshabukira kwa undi mwishirya wa lwichi lwe Yorotani. Mibuanano mingi ya bandu ikoranira mwa mbere siwe. Naye nianatangira iiyisabo nga kwabaa atula aira.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bafarisayo bauma niabanamuhikira kwemuereka. niabanamubutsa mbu: «Mbeni aMuomba wetu ahere mundu yo rubu lwehentsa mukatsi uwe?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Musa abateekaate?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Musa ahaa amundu yo rubu lweandika maruba mesiya mukatsi uwe, nenyuma waho, ni amuhentsa.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Musa abaandikiraa areteeko iro kubwishi bwa butsibu bwa myete yenyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Wetuwe ihuluka he Ongo abumbiraa abindu byoshe, nianabumba mulume na mukatsi. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Kubwishi bwekyo, amulume endesiya ishe ne nina nebumbana ne mukatsi uwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />na babiri abo ni baba mubiri muuma. Batyo, abo ni batakiri babiri kandi, wetuwe ni bameba mubiri muuma. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Kubatyo, amundu ni atilikalikanye kyo Ongo abumbanyaa hauma.»<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Babere bahara mwa nyumba, abemitsa ba Yesu niabanamubutsa kandi kuluenda akinwa ikyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Kintsi mundu yasiyana ne mukatsi uwe nehikya undi, ni asingira nekolera amukatsi muxondotsi yo ntsambi. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Anabe na kintsi mukatsi yasiyana na mulume uwe nehikibwa na undi mulume, ni asingira.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aashanira abana balere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bandu bauma niabanaletera Yesu yo bana mbu nge ahira kubo asaminwe, wetuwe abemitsa bewe niabanakemera abandu abo. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu abere axunga atyo, nianatsibuka kutsibu ni yabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Munerelika abana balere berewicha yo niri, muterehangirabo, kubwishi aBwami bwa Ongo bwa bandu bali ngakuno aba. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Mwa kuli anibabwira imwe, ku mundu woshewoshe yataangirira aBwami bwa Ongo nga mwana mulere, atangakocha iingira mubo kiro na hake.»<verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Inyuma kwaho, nianakokera abana, nianahira kubo asaminwe, neashanirabo.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mutabana muxoki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu abere ahara mwa nchira, mundu muuma nianamuhikira chuba, nianashinga amapfi mwa mbere siwe nemubwira mbu: «Mwiyisa mubuya, niire nite kwebula mbu nikoche ilya kwa mwandu wa buingo bwa biro byoshe?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu nianamubutsa mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki auniluka mubuya? Hatali mundu mubuya ali ate Ongo yewene. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Wichi areteeko rolibwire mbu: ‹Utereita, uteresingira, utereiba, uterehambika mundu yo kinwa, uteretinga, unerepfa ixo ne nyoko bo xoni.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 20:12-16; Muubuko 5:16-20.</char></note>» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Amundu uyo nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Mwiyisa, amateeko moshe ayo, ninakola nga ko ma bwire ihuluka abwana bwani.»<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu nianamusindera mu ntsiyi, nianamubwira mbu: «Uhushire kindu kiuma kyokilirene ikola: ‹Enda uutse abindu byoshe byo uli nabyo, na safaranga seukabonekya unahato abachene, nawe ukaba na mbikyo mu mbingu. Inyuma kwaho, wiche unikulikire!›» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Wetuwe amutabana uyo abere ahulikya abinwa ibyo, nianatsitsikana, abaneiendera mu bwoncho, kubwishi abaa muxoki kutsibu.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu nianasindera kwa minda yoshe, nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Mwa kuli, litsibuhire kwa baxoki kweingira mwa Bwami bwa Ongo.»<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Abemitsa niabanashishala kutsibu kweumpfa abinwa ibyo. Wetuwe Yesu nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Mwe bana bani, litsibu kwa baxoki kweingira mwa Bwami bwa Ongo! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Lianguhire kutsibu kwa ngamiya kwetsuka mwa kisha kya nandi, irengya amuxoki kweingira mwa Bwami bwa Ongo.»<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Abemitsa babere baumpfa abinwa ibyo niabanaongerera ishishala kutsibu, baba nebutsabutsanya bonabene ku bonabene mbu: «Indeno yangakocha iufulwa?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu nianasinderabo nebwirabo mbu: «Kwa mundu kitangakocheka, wetuwe ku Ongo lute lutyo, kubwishi abinwa byoshe binakocheka ku Ongo.»<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petero nianamubwira mbu: «Talola kwitwe twasiyire abyoshe nekukulikira.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Mwa kuli anibabwira kwamundu ni angaba akesiya anyumba yiwe, ne muala wabo, ne mwali wabo, ne ishe, ne nina, na bana bewe, neri na maxwa mewe kubwishi bwa ingye na kubwishi bwa Mwatsi Mubuya, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />akahembwa ngendo iana mo kianiro kino. Akahembwa nyumba, na baala babo, na bali babo, ne nina, na bana , na maxwa hauma na minubo. Na mwa kianiro kyokihika akahembwa abuingo bwa biro byoshe. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Wetuwe bangi mwa babere, bendeba batsindu, na bangi mwa batsindu bendeba babere.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alupfu na repfuka ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Babere bahara baurukira i Yerusalemu, Yesu nianaxondolera abemitsa bewe, nabo niabanatsimbwa na buba. Abandu bobamukulikiraa, nabo batsimbwa na buba. Yesu nianatsimba kandi abemitsa bewe ikumi na babiri, nianatangira isimola nabo kuluenda abinwa byobyendemuhikira. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Twauruka i Yerusalemu neyo, Muala wa Mundu akahirwa mwa minwe sa boshebakungu na beyisa ba Muomba. Nabo bakamuchira lubancha mbu aitwe nehirwa mwa minwe sa bandu ba sindi nganda. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bakamushekenyula, nemuchirako mate, bakamukubita ngonyi nemwita. Wetuwe mwa lwire lwa kashatu inyuma ya repfa liwe, akapfuka.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuhita wa Yakobo ne Yohana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Inyuma kwaho, baala babiri ba Sebetayo, Yakobo ne Yohana niabanahikira Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, atuxonda mbu utukolere kinwa kyotukakuhema.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Amuxonda mbu nibakolereki?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Mwa mango wendeba mwa ngulu yawe, unendetuha rubu lweikala hauma nawe, muuma kwa munda wawe wa malyo na undi kwa munda wawe wa malembe.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Wetuwe Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Mutechi akindu kyomuhema. Mungakocha ixoma akiriko kya minubo kyonikendexoma? Neri mungakocha irubikwa mwa burubike bwa lupfu bonikarubikwamo?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Twangakocha.» Yesu nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Mwa kuli mukaxoma kwa kiriko kyonikendexomako, nerubikwa nga konikenderubikwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Wetuwe areikatsa amundu kwa munda wani wa malyo, neri wa malembe uyo ate mulimo wani. Ongo yenawene yakendeikatsa abandu mwa maali makoleraabo.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Abandi bemitsa ikumi babere baumpfa abinwa ibyo, niabanayongerwa Yakobo ne Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu nianabirangira aboshe nebwirabo mbu: «Mwichi ku bobaxungwa nga bemanitsi ba bobate Bayahuti, banaimanirabo mu nyiki na bakulukulu babo banaikalira kubo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Wetuwe lutabaa lutyo mwa kati kenyu. Yakendexonda iba mukulukulu mwa kati kenyu, ni alirene iba mupfuku wenyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Na yaxonda iba mubere, ni alirene iba mupfuku wa boshe. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kubwishi anabe ne Muala wa Mundu atawichaa ikolerwa, wetuwe ikola netula abuingo buwe kwebula mbu atongotse bandu bangi.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya Baritolomayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe, niabanahika i Yeriko. Ne Yesu abere ali yatenga iyo, kuuma na bemitsa bewe na mubuanano munene wa bandu, mundu muuma kihumahumi yabaa alukwa mbu ye Baritolomayo muala wa Timayo, abaa ni aikere kwa musike wa nchira ni ahemahema. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Abere aumpfa mbu Yesu we Nasareti yatsuka mwa nchira iyo, nianabula mbu: «Yesu Muala wa Ndauti, nipfire bwoncho!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bandu bangi niabanamukemera mbu atsire, wetuwe nianaxuba ilaka mbu: «Yesu Muala wa Ndauti, unipfire bwoncho!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu nianatindira nebula mbu: «Mumubirangire.» Niabanabiragirakyo nemubwirakyo mbu: «Simika! Batuka, akubirangira.»<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Baritolomayo nianalekera arekoti liwe, nianaixukya chuba newicha ho Yesu ali. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu nianamubutsa mbu: «Auxonda mbu nikukolereki?» Akihumahumi niakinamuxubyitsa mbu: «Mwiyisa, anixonda mbu nilole.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Iendere, abwimire bwawe bwamekulamya.» Mo kashangi umoho, nianabanelola. Nianakulikira Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aingira i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanahika hofi na mulungu we Yerusalemu, kwa munda wa mitsi ye Betifake ne Betaniya, hofi na kitwa kye Miseituni. Yesu nianalika babiri mwa bemitsa bewe. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Muende mwa mutsi wali ira buxondotsi kwimwe. Mwa mango mukahika iyo, mukaxunga ku kyana kya punda kiabikire, na mundu woshewoshe atatsakambira kukyo. Munaabulakyo neletakyo hano. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Hakeba mundu yababutsa mbu: ‹Mwamekola mutyo kubwishi bwaki?› Ni mwamubwira mbu Ninakuwetu alaire kukyo. Akafulukyakyo hano inyuma hake.»<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Niabanaenda, niabanaxunga kwa kyana kya punda ni kiabikire hambua, hofi na lukyo lwa nyumba kwa musike wa muhengere. Babere bali yobaabulakyo, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />abandu bobabaa aho, niabanabutsabo mbu: «Kiki kyomukola? Mwameabula akyana kya punda iki kubwishi bwaki?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Niabanaxubyitsabo ngakuno ko Yesu shabwirabo, na bandu abo niabanalikabo mbu baende.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Niabanaletera Yesu akyana kya punda neshesha asangimba sabo kukyo, ne Yesu nianaikala kukyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bandu bangi niabanashesha asangimba sabo mwa nchira, na bandi niabanashesha ndabi sobachaa mwa maxwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Abandu bobabaa baxondolere Yesu, na bobabaa bamukulikire, niabanatangira ilaka mu mulenge mule mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">«Hosana, asingyibwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Aashanirwe uyu yawicha mwetsina ra Ninakuwetu!<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Buashanirwe abwami bobuwicha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">bo bwami bwa tata Ndauti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Hosana Nina mu mbingu asingyibwe!»<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu nianahika i Yerusalemu neya mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char>. Abere ameotola ilola kwa bindu byoshe kwa minda yoshe, nianaenda i Betaniya kuuma na bemitsa bewe ikumi na babiri, kubwishi lwabaa ni luhara luoloolo.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atukanga amuti wa tini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Bwabere bwakya, bali yobatenga i Betaniya, Yesu nianakukutsa. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Nianaxunga muti wa tini hale ni aliko bisani bingi. Nianaya isisiritsa ngakuno angaxungako bipfuma. Wetuwe abere ahika hofi nao, ataxungako kindu, biri bite abisani bishaho, kubwishi kyabaa kite kianiro kya bipfuma. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Niyo Yesu atukanga amuti uyo mbu: «Ihuluka tsene na ku biro byoshe hatakiba yakendelya kipfuma kya kwiwe.» Abemitsa bewe niabanaumpfa abinwa byaneenaa.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahentsa abachurutsi mwa hekalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Inyuma kwaho, niabanahika i Yerusalemu. Yesu abere aingira mwa hekalu, nianatangira ihentsa abachurutsi mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char>. Nianakunulanga amesa ma bobabaa abahingya asafaranga na bipfumbi bya bachurutsi ba makuku. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Nianahangira abandu itsuka mwa mbua ya <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char> na mitsio yabo.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésu chasse les marchants dans le temple" file="WA03896b.tif" size="col" ref="11:16">Yesu ahentsa abachurutsi mwa Hekalu</figure>.<verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Nianaiyisabo mbu: «Kiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire mbu anyumba yani yendelukwa nyumba ya mahemo kwa nganda soshe. Wetuwe imwe mwameirayo lukunda lwa banyai banakoraniramo.»<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Boshebakungu na beyisa ba Muomba babere baumpfa amwatsi uyo, niabanaxonda kobangaita Yesu. Wetuwe bamuubaha, kubwishi amubuanano woshe wa bandu ni abashishalira ameyiso mewe.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Lwabere lwahara luoloolo, Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanatenga mwa mutsi umo.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ameyiso momatengire kwa muti wa tini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Mwelutumbi, bali yobatsuka, niabanaxunga amuti wa tini uyo awoshe ni ameuma ihikira kwa milya yao. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petero nianaubuka abinwa byobyatsukaa lubere, nianabwira Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, sindera ku amuti wa tini wo watukangaa ameuma!»<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Munereimirira Ongo. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Mwa kuli anibabwira ku amundu angabwira akitwa iki mbu kitenge aha kiiume mwa nyancha. Na iri aneena abinwa ibyo butsira mitikotiko mwa mwete uwe, wetuwe ali aimirire kwa kinwa ikyo kikakolwa, mwa kuli ni kikanakolwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kubwishi bwekyo, anibabwira ku mwa mango amuhema kubwishi bwa kindu kirebe, ni mwaba na bwimire ku mwameotola iangirirakyo, na mwa nchira umo ni mukahabwakyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Na mwa mango mwabatuka muli yo mwahema, mukeubuka ku muli na kinwa na undi mundu, ni mwamushashira, kwebula mbu Tata yali mu mbingu, akoche ibashashira nemwe asantsambi senyu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Wetuwe mutashashire abandi bandu, ne Tata yanaba mu mbingu ni atibashashire nemwe asantsambi senyu.» <verse eid="MRK 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu na bemitsa bewe niabanahika kandi i Yerusalemu. Yesu abere ali yatamba mwa hekalu, boshebakungu, na beisa ba Muomba kuuma na bemanitsi ba bandu, niabanamuhikira. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Aukola abindu ibi mu maalaki? Nende yakuhaa amaala ama?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Nikababutsa kinwa kiumaho. Mukenixubitsa, nani ni nikababwira nga mu maalaki mo nerekolamo abinwa ibi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Yohana ahabwaa amaala ma rerubika itenga ira mwande? Matengaa ira mwa Ongo neri matengaa ku bandu? Munixubitse!»<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Niabanabutsabutsanya mbu: «Tukexubya kwa maala mewe matengaa ira mwa Ongo, ni akatubutsa mbu: ‹Mutamwimiriraa kubwishi bwaki?› <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Na kandi tutangabula mbu matengaa ku bandu.» Baubahaa amubuanano wa bandu kubwishi aboshe babaa baimirire ku Yohana <char style="w" lemma="mutahwa">mutahwa</char> wa kuli. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Niabanaxubyitsa Yesu mbu: «Tutechi.» Ne Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Anabe nani nitibabwire nga mu mahe maala monikolamo abinwa ibi.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mushinga wa bahingi babi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianaxuba ineena mu mishinga na bakulukulu ba Bayahuti mbu: «Mundu muuma nianabyala <char style="w" lemma="misabibu">misabibu</char> mu ixwa liwe. Nianatsungutsako mupfunda, nehimbamo mulinga we kamiramo abipfuma bya misabibu. Nianahimbamo na nyumba nyire yarelangiramo arexwa. Inyuma kwaho nianabwekyaro kwa bahingi nianaya mu kihuo mbinga. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Abiro byarexola byabere byaeraho, nianalika mupfuku uwe muuma kwebinga amuhango uwe wa mwexwa ra misabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Wetuwe abahingi abo batsimba amupfuku uyo, bamuhumba nemufulukya minwe misha. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Nina arexwa nianalika undi mupfuku kubo. Uyo naye, niabanamubabatsa kwa mutwe nemukamba. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Nina arexwa nianalika kandi undi mupfuku, uyo niabanamwita. Inyuma kwaho, nianalika bandi bapfuku bangi. Abahingi abo, bahumba bauma mubo na bandi baitabo. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Nina arexwa anashibaaho na mundu muuma, naye abaa ni muala mutsiyirwa uwe. Mwa ntsindiro, nianamulika kubo mbu: ‹Nichi ku bakapfa muala wani yo xoni.› <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Wetuwe abahingi abo babere bamuxunga kwahika, niabananeena bonabene ku bonabene mbu: ‹Mulole kuyu ye muli wa mwandu wa rexwa lino. Kunchi tumwite, na rexwa lino likaba mwandu wetu!› <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Kubatyo niabanatsimba muala uyo, nemwita nelekera andundwe kwa musike wa rexwa ra misabibu.»<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Niyo Yesu abutsabo mbu: «Amuanikira mbu nina arexwa ra misabibu iyo akakolaki? Akawicha ikonola abahingi abo. Nenyuma kwaho niakendexonda bandi bapfuku behinga arexwa iro. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Mutatsa mwasoma kwa Maandiko Makomire mabwire mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‹Arebale ra bahimbi batindaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">rorameba ibale linene ra kwa musingi wa nyumba.›»<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ninakuwetu yamekola akinwa iki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">nakyo kyametushishatsa kutsibu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kutsibu! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 118:22-23.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Niyo abakulukulu abo baxonda itsimba Yesu, kubwishi ni bamekengula kwa mushinga washacha uyo, ali kubo. Wetuwe kubwishi bwareubaha amubuanano wa bandu, niabanamusiya mbu aiendere.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arefuta akoli ya Kaisari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Inyuma kwaho, niabanalika Bafarisayo bauma kuuma na kikanga kya Herote kweya itea Yesu kinwa mu bya neena. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Niabanawicha imubwira mbu: «Mwiyisa, twichi ku uli mundu wa kuli. Utaubahire mundu, abandu boshe balingene mwa mbere sawe, kubwishi utalinda waneena mbu uyu mundu mukulukulu. Aubaneiyisa abandu akuli ya nchira ya Ongo. Utubwire ngakuno aMuomba atuhere rubu lwefuta koli kwa mwami Kaisari neri ihi?»<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Wetuwe Yesu nianakengula ku abandu abo, ba tulimi tubiri. Nianabwirabo mbu: «Amuniereka kubwishi bwaki? Muniletere kichere kiuma kya lufaranga hano nilole kukyo.»<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Niabanamuletera akichere kya lufaranga, nianabutsabo mbu: «Ashushani iyi yande? Na aretsina iri rande?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Niabanamuxubyitsa mbu: «Bya Kaisari.»<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Niyo Yesu abwirabo mbu: «Muhe Kaisari biwe ne Ongo biwe.»<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arepfuka ra bapfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Basandukayo">Basandukayo</char> bauma bobananeena mbu abapfu batendepfuka, bahikira Yesu nemubutsa mbu: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Mwiyisa, Musa atuhere iteeko roliandikirwe mbu: ‹Mulume yahikitse akepfa atabutire mwana, mulumuna uwe ni aingirira amuxumbakatsi uyo, kwebutira wali mukulu uwe yo bana.› <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Kubatyo, aho habaa balume balinda ba bula buuma. Afula niainahikya mukatsi, wetuwe nianapfa butsira ibuta kiro na mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Muala wabo wa kabiri nianaingirira amuxumbakatsi uyo, naye nianapfa butsira ibuta mwana. Nialunaba lutyo ku muala wabo wa kashatu, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />na balinda boshe bapfa butsira mwana. Inyuma wa lupfu lwabo, amukatsi naye nianapfa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Kubatyo, mwa lwire lwarepfuka ra bapfu, amukatsi uyo, endeba wande kubwishi abalinda boshe babaa naye?»<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Mwameitinga kureba mutechi aMaandiko Makomire neri amaala ma Ongo. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Kureba mwa mango abapfu bendepfuka, bendebaho ngakuno kwa bamalaika banabaho mu mbingu. Batendehikya neri ihikibwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Na kuluenda arepfuka ra bapfu, mutatsamwasoma mwa kitabo kya Muomba wa Musa, kyo Ongo amubwiraa mwa kitundi kyokyabaa akiulumira? Nianamubwira mbu: ‹Ingye, ngye Ongo wa Iburahimu, Ongo wa Isake, ne Ongo wa Yakobo.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 3:6.</char></note>»<verse eid="MRK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yesu nianaxuba ibwirabo mbu: «Ongo ate Ongo wa bapfu, wetuwe Ongo wa bobaliho. Kubatyo, imwe muhabukire kutsibu.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Areteeko rolirengitse amoshe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mwiyisa muuma wa Muomba abaa aliho, mwa mango Yesu abaa akubirisanya na Basandukayo. Iye nianakengula ku Yesu amexubyitsabo kushe. Kubatyo, nianaipfunda hofi naye nemubutsa mbu: «Lihe reteeko rolirengitse amandi moshe?»<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Areteeko rolilengitse amandi mateeko moshe rolino: ‹Umpfa mwe luanda lwa Isiraeli, Ninakuwetu Ongo ye Ninakuwetu yenawene. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Tsiyira Ninakuwetu Ongo wawe, mwa mwete wawe woshe, na mwa mutima wawe woshe, na mwa bwenge bwawe bwoshe, na mwa maala mawe moshe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Muubuko 6:4-5.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Na reteeko rakabiri ni rolino: ‹Uneretsiyira amuhuwene wawe ngakuno kouitsiyire wonawene.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Balawi 19:18.</char></note> Hatali lindi teeko lirengitse ayo.»<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Amwiyisa wa Muomba uyo nianabwira Yesu mbu: «Likwirire, ee Mwiyisa! Wameneena kuli ku Ongo muuma yenaweneho na ku hatali undi Ongo ali ate iye. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Na mundu alirene itsiyira Ongo mwa mwete uwe woshe, na mwa bwenge buwe bwoshe, na mwa maala mewe moshe. Naye alirene itsiyira amuhuwene uwe nga kwanaitsiyire yenawene. Ibyo bikwirire irengya itula Ongo yo mutulo wa nyama ishititse na indi mitulo yoshe.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Oseya 6:6.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu abere amexunga ku amexubya mu bwenge, nianamubwira mbu: «Ute hale na Bwami bwa Ongo.» Inyuma kwaho hataboneka mundu yamubutsa kindi kinwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alubuto na bukulukulu bwa Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Lwire luuma Yesu abaa ni aiyisa mwa hekalu nianabutsa mbu: «Mbeni bate ko abeyisa ba Muomba banganeena mbu Kirisitu muala wa Ndauti? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ndauti yewene, aendibwaa na Mutima Akomire aneenaa mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‹Ninakuwetu Ongo nianabwira Ninakuwetu mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Ikala kwa munda wani wa malyo, ihikira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">honikendehira abalenda bawe hatako wa bishando byawe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 110:1.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Ndauti yewene aluka Kirisitu mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:37">‹Ninakuwetu›.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:37">Bateno ko Kirisitu uyo, angaxuba iba Muala wa Ndauti?»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Meyiso kuluenda abeyisa ba Muomba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Kikanga kinene kya bandu babaa abaumpfiritsa Yesu mu lumoo.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Mwa meyiso mewe nianabwirabo mbu: «Munerekohya kwa beyisa ba Muomba. Baneretsiyira itamba ni baimbere twantsu tule, neketsibwa mu lubaho mwa mibuanano. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Na kandi banatsiira ikala kwa bipfumbi bya ira buxondotsi mwa masinakoki na ho hali linye. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Banerenyaa abitwe bya baxumbakatsi, nehema mahemo ma kishangi kire kwebula mbu balolweko na bandu. Kubwishi bwekyo bendechirwa lubancha lutsibu!»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amutulo wa muxumbakatsi muchene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianaikala mwa hekalu hofi na sanduku ya mitulo. Nialola kwabandu abatula. Baxoki bangi niabanatula bitwe bingi mwa sanduku umo. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Muxumbakatsi muuma muchene, naye nianawicha. Nianatoetsamo bichere bibiri bya faranga bya kichiro kike kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Niyo Yesu abirangira abemitsa bewe nebwirabo mbu: «Mwa kuli anibabwira ku amuxumbakatsi muchene uyu, yametula bingi irengya abandu boshe bobametula faranga mwa sanduku ya mitulo. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kureba abandi boshe aba bametula amisialitsa ya kwa muhango wa kwa bitwe byabo. Wetuwe amuxumbakatsi uyu mwa buchene buwe, ametula abitwe biwe byoshe, byaweteko kwebaho liwe.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Areshambulwa ra hekalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu abere atenga mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char>, muuma wa mwa bemitsa bewe nianamubwira mbu: «Mwiyisa, talola kwa mabale na buhimbe ubu ko buli!»<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Utsene kwa buhimbe bunene ubu? Mwa kuli anikubwira, hatendeshiba ibale literekire ku lindi. Amoshe makendeshambulwa.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abinwa bya ntsindiro ya kihuo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Mwa mango Yesu abaa aikere kwa kitwa kye Miseituni, ierekera kwa munda wa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">hekalu</char>, Petero, ne Yakobo, ne Yohana, ne Andereya babere bali bonabene kuuma naye, niabanamubutsa mbu: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Mwiyisa, utubwire, abinwa byowameneena ibi byendeba mangoki? Na kahe kokalolero kokakendebwerekya kwa byoshe ibi abixonda iberera?»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Niyo Yesu atangira ibwirabo mbu: «Munakohya hatabaa mundu yabatinga. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Kubwishi bandu bangi bendewicha mwetsina rani, ni ababula mbu: ‹Ingye, ngye Kirisitu!› Nabo bendetinga bandu bangi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Mwa mango mwendehulikya ahulihuli ya bulenda ni mutiubahe. Abinwa ibyo binalirene ihika. Wetuwe ni bitabibwerekya kwa ntsindiro ya kihuo yamehika. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Kureba luanda lwendelwa na lundi. Na bwami bwendelwa na bundi. Ahoshe hendetsuka tulingiti na bulio kwa kihuo. Na byoshe ibi byendeba ngakuno ndangiro ya luhe.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />«Kubatyo, munakohya kushe, kubwishi mwendetwalwa ku kibu, nebakubita mu ngonyi mwa<char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">masinakoki</char>. Na kandi mwendetwalwa mwa mbere sa bakulukulu, na bami kubwishi bwa ingye. Kwebula mbu mupfule amwatsi wa kuluenda ingye mwa mbere sabo.» <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kubatyo, aMwatsi Mubuya alirene ni atangapfulwa kasa kwa nganda soshe. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Mwa mango mukenderetsimbwa kwechirwa lubancha, ni mutiiririkane buxondotsi bwa kianiro, kuluenda abinwa byomukendereneena. Wetuwe ni mukendereneena abinwa byomukenderehabwa mo kashangi umo. Kubwishi bitenderetenga mwimwe mwenabene, wetuwe byenderetenga mwa Mutima Akomire.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Abandu bakenderehotera banyakyabo kwebula mbu baitwe. Na babuti bakenderehotera abana babo. Na bana nabo, bakenderebindukira ababuti babo neitabo. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Na bandu boshe benderebabaa kubwishi bwa ingye. Wetuwe yakendebeera ihikira kwa ntsindiro, endeufulwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubao lwa bubihya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Wetuwe mwendeba mwaxunga ku yalukwa mbu ye «lubao lwabubihya» lolwameterekwa holutalirene iba, yasoma abinwa ibi, ni amenya iki. Aboshe bobakendeba mwa Yuteya, ni bashaira kwa bitwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Na yakendeshinganwa kwa muutu wa nyumba, ni atikikime kweingira mwa nyumba mbu atengyemo bindu. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Na mundu yakendeshinganwa mwexwa, ni atikifulukire mwa nyumba kandi kwebingamo alukimba luwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Abakatsi bakule na bobaongya balyae alwire ulo. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Muheme Ongo kwebula mbu abinwa ibyo bitendebahikira mu kibulaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kubwishi aminubo ya biro ibyo yendeba minubo mitsibu, minubo yoitatangaa yaxungwako kiro na hake, ihuluka he Ongo abumbiraa akihuo ihikira tsene. Hatikyendeba kandi kiro na indi minubo iri nga iyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ninakuwetu ali atakehyaa abiro bya minubo ibyo, nge hatali kiro na mundu muuma yangaufulwa. Wetuwe abiro ibyo amekehyabyo, kubwishi bwa bandu balondolaa.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />«Amundu akebabwira mbu: ‹Lola <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char> ali hano›, neri ‹ali halaa›, ni mutimwimirire. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kubwishi kwendepfumbuka bandu bobailuka mu bubesi mbu bo <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu">Kirisitu</char>, kuuma na batahwa ba bubesi, nabo bakenderekola tulolero na bishishatsa kwebula mbu liri lingakocheka nehabukya abalondolwa ba Ongo. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Mukohye! Nameotola ibatondera lubere.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arewicha ra Muala wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Wetuwe mo biro umo inyuma ya minubo iyo, aretsuba ritikendekola na mwetsi atikyendekoletsa, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />asanyenyetsi sendetoanga itenga mu mbingu, na byoshe byo biri na maala, byo biri mu mbingu byendetinganyibwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 13:10; 34: 4.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Niyo bakendexunga Muala wa Mundu na wicha mwa bipfu kuuma na maala mangi na ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Naye endelika abamalaika bewe be mu mbingu kwa minda ine yoshe ya kihuo, nekongya abandu bewe balondolaa kwetenga kwa kihuo kyoshe.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa muti wa tini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Amuti wa tini abe mushinga kwimwe. Mwa mango asandabi sao saxoa, na amasani maxoa, imwe ni mwakengula kwa kianiro kya kyanda kiri hofi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Konoko, mwa mango mwendexunga abianiro ibyo biri yobyahika, ni mwamenya kwiye ali hofi, na kwali kwa lukyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Mwa kuli anibabwira kwa alubuto lwenyu luno lutendetsuka, abinwa byoshe ibi bitatsabyabererera. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Ambingu na kihuo byendetsuka, wetuwe abinwa byani bitendetsuka kiro na hake.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongo yechi akashangi ka ntsindiro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Wetuwe hatali mundu yechi alwire na saa, banabe na bamalaika ba mu mbingu, anabe ne Muala. Tata yenaweneho yanechi. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mukohye kubwishi mutechi ngakuno akashangi ako kakendewicha mangoki. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Rendeba nga amundu aya mu luendo. Abere atenga mwamwe nianasiira abakotsi bewe bo mulimo. Nianaha kintsi mundu amulimo uwe. Niyo aha amulangi wa lukyo rubu mbu akohye. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Kubatyo mukohye, kubwishi mutechi mwa mango nina anyumba endewicha. Kuti mu luoloolo, neri mu kati ka kiro, neri axongole yakokobika, neri mwemakyerakyera. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Mukohye, atangendewicha mu kifulumuko, nebashingana ni mwameya tulo. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Abinwa byonibabwira imwe, nabwirabyo abandu boshe mbu: «Mukohye.»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Nama yareita Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-6">Mat 26:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Kwabaa kwashiba biro bibiri lubere lwa lwire lukulu lwa <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char>, na lwa mikati yoitalimo chachu. Boshebakungu na beyisa ba <char style="w" lemma="Muomba">Muomba</char> baxonda nchira yetsimba Yesu mu buxuma kwebula mbu bamwite. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Wetuwe niabanabula mbu: «Tutamutsimbaa mwa lwire lukulu kwebula mbu hatangechehuluka kahinchangano mwa bandu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amukatsi ahungulira Yesu yo lungo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu abaa ali i Betaniya mwa nyumba ya Simoni Mubentsi. Babere bali yobalya, mukatsi muuma nianaingira mwa nyumba. Abaa na ngaha ye bale ya lungo lwa kichiro kinene lolukolirwe mu mauwa ma narito ikwirire. Nianapfunula angaha iyo nehungulira alungo kwa mutwe wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bauma mwa bandu bobabaa aho bayongerwa kinwa ikyo, nebula mbu: «Alungo ulu lwamepfa busha kuki?» <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Alungo ulo nge lungautsibwa mu kichiro kya tinari maana mashatu ma faranga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abichere bya safaranga ibyo, byabaa abilukwa «Tinari». Asatinari maana mashatu ayo, sabaa faranga sepfuha mundu yamekola mulimo wa mwaka muuma.</char></note>, neabira abitwe ibyo kwa bachene. Niabanakemera amukatsi uyo kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mumulike! Amumunubya kubushi bwaki? Iye amenikolera kinwa kibuya kutsibu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Kubwishi mukendereba na bachene abiro byoshe, na kubatyo mungakocha iyasikyabo akashangi koshe ko mushashire. Wetuwe ingye nitendeba kuuma nemwe abiro byoshe. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Amukatsi uyo amekola nga kwangakocha. Amehaka amubiri wani wo lungo buxondotsi, kwenitunganyanya kubwishi bwa retabwa rani. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Mwa kuli anibabwira mbu kubwishi bwareubuka amukatsi uyu, akinwa kyamekola iki, kyendereshambalwa ahoshe ha Mwatsi Mubuya akenderepfulwa kwa kihuo kyoshe.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuta Isikariote aikiritsa ihota Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yuta Isikariyote, muuma wa mwa bemitsa ikumi na babiri, nianaendera boshebakungu kwehotera Yesu kubo. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Babere bahulikya amwatsi uyo, niabanamoa kutsibu. Niabanamuha manihisa memuha faranga. Yuta nianatangira ixonda nchira ikwirire ye muhotera.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abemitsa batunganyanya ambiya ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-23">Luk 22:7-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Alwire lukulu lubere lwa mikati yoitalimo chachu, mwa mango babaa abakera ambuli ya <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char>, abemitsa ba Yesu niabanamubutsa mbu: «Hai houxonda mbu tukulingiriranyitse ambiya ya <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char>?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Niyo Yesu alika babiri mwa bemitsa bewe nebwirabo mbu: «Muende mwa mulungu, nomo mukatimanamo mundu muuma yahete kibindi kya mechi. Munakulikira amundu uyo, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />na mwakaingira ni mwabwira nina anyumba iyo mbu: ‹Mwiyisa abutsa mbu mbeni hai ho hali akyumba kiwe mwakalira ambiya ya <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char> kuuma na bemitsa bewe?› <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Naye akababwerekya mbyangali ya kwa korofa ilingiriranyibwe netondwa kushe. Umo momukatutunganyitsa ambiya ya Pasaka.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Abemitsa niabanaenda. Babere bahika mwa mulungu, niabanatimana abindu byoshe ni biri nga ko Yesu shabwirabo. Nabo niabanatunganyanya ambiya ya <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">Pasaka</char>.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ambiya ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:14-23">Mat 22:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Bwabere bwameoloba, Yesu nianawicha kuuma na bemitsa bewe ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Babere bali yobalya, Yesu nianabula mbu: «Mwa kuli anibabwira ku muuma mwimwe yalya kuuma nani akanihotera.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Abemitsa bewe niabanayongwa nemubutsa muuma muuma mbu: «Mbeni ingye?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu nianaxubyitsabo mbu: «Muuma mwimwe, mwe ikumi na babiri, yabobetsa amukati kuuma nani mwa mbale yakanihotera. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Kureba Muala wa Mundu akapfa nga kwa Maandiko Makomire mabwire kuluenda iye; wetuwe alyae amundu yamuhotera! Ni shalirirene amundu uyo ni shatangabutirwe.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amubiri na shiama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Babere bali yo balya, Yesu nianatsimba amukati, nianaashanirao, nianacha muo, nehao abemitsa bewe mbu: «Mutole amukati uyu, wo mubiri wani.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Inyuma kwaho, nianatsimba alungu, nianasima Ongo, nehalobo. Aboshe niabanaxoma. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Iyi yo shiama yani yoikapfubuka kubwishi bwa bandu bangi kwebereretsa andaane ya Ongo.» <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Mwa kuli anibabwira mbu: «Ihuluka tsene, nitikyendexoma kandi ku tifai ihikira alwire lonikendexomamo buhya mwa Bwami bwa Ongo.»<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Babere bameotola iwimba niabanabatuka kweya kwa kitwa kye Miseituni.<note caller="+" style="f">t<char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBayahuti babaa banaimba asaburi 115 ihikira ku 118 inyuma wa mbiya ya Pasaka.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero alahitsa ku atiiane Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36">Yoh 13:36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Mwe boshe mukanisiya, kubwishi aMaandiko Makomire mabwire mbu: ‹Nikaita amusumba na sa mbuli sikashanchwa.› <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Mwa mango nikapfuka, nikabaxondolera kweya i Ngalilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petero nianamubwira mbu: «Nakiro mbu abandi boshe bakakusiya, wetuwe ingye, nitikusiye kiro na hake.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Mwa kuli, anikubwira ku mwe kiro muno, buxondotsi axongole ikokobike kabiri, ukaba ni wameiana ingye kashatu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Wetuwe Petero nianaiminga kutsibu, neneena mbu: «Nakiro mbu nilirene ipfa kuuma nawe, nitiyiane iwe kiro na hake.» Na bandi boshe niabananeena batyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahemera mwexwa re Ngetsemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Inyuma kwaho, niabanahika mu ixwa rolilukwa mbu Ketsemani, ne Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Muikale hano nani naya ihema.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Nianaenda kuuma ne Petero, ne Yakobo, ne Yohana. Nianatangira iyongwa neiririkana. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Batyo nianabwirabo mbu: «Amwete wani auchwire buyongwa bwehikira luero lwepfa! Mushibe hano, mukohye!» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Inyuma kwaho nianaisiika hake kubo, nianashinga amapfi hashi kwehema Ongo mbu liri lingakocheka, akashangi ka minubo kamutengerere. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Nianabula mbu: «Abba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Abba» Kinwa kya Kiaramu kyokiahula ishe uwe kushekushe yaneena, neri yo baahula.</char></note>, ee Tata! Abyoshe bingakocheka kwiwe. Anikuhema mbu unitengyetse alungu lwa minubo ulu. Wetuwe litabaa nga konishashire, wetuwe libe nga koushashire.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Abere afuluka ha bemitsa bashatu bali, nianatimanabo ni bameya tulo. Nianabwira Petero mbu: «Simoni, wameya tulo? Utakochitse ikereresa kiro na saa nguma? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Mukohye, nehema Ongo, mutangechetoera mu miereko, kubwishi amutima murai, wetuwe amubiri mutetera.» <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Nianasiabo kandi kweya ihema, nexuba mwa binwa ibyoho. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Abere afuluka kandi, nianatimana abemitsa abo ni bamexuba iya tulo, kubwishi amesha mabo ni mametama, ni batakichi na kobangamuxubitsa. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Abere afuluka ra kashatu, nianabwirabo mbu: «Mukinali tulo netamuka? Koshoko! Tsene akashangi kameeraho. Muala wa Mundu akaterekwa mwa minwe sa bandu ba santsambi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mubatuke, tuende! Yanihotera ahara hofi.»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBahayuti batsimba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu abere akinali aneena, Mu kashalimo, Yuta muuma wa bemitsa ikumi na babiri, nianahika kuuma na kichiri kinene kya bandu bobali na mahombo, na ngonyi. Aboshi abobabaa nibamelikwa na boshebakungu, na beyisa ba Muomba, na bangumwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuta yahoteraa Yesu, abaa ni ameotola ibwerekyabo akalolero aka mbu: «Ula yanikakokera niye. Ni mwamutsimba, nemutwala ni mumulangire kushe.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuta abere ahika, nianasheera ho Yesu ali nemubwira mbu: «Mwiyisa!» Nianamukokera. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Niyo abandu abo batsimba Yesu nemumina. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Wetuwe muuma mu bobabaa aho, nianatomola abuhombo buwe mwa hara necha arekwitwi ra mupfuku wa shebakungu.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mwamewicha na mahombo, na ngonyi, kwenitsimba ngakuno bandu bobaya itsimba munyai? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Nabaa nereba kuuma nemwe abiro byoshe nianiyisa mwa hekalu, mutanitsimbaa. Wetuwe abinwa ibi byameba bitya kwebula mbu aMaandiko Makomire mabererere.»<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Abemitsa bewe boshe niabanashaa nemusiya. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Wetuwe mutabana muuma yabaa aimbere kikwembe, nianakulikira Yesu. Baereka imutsimba, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />wetuwe nianalikula akikwembe kiwe neshaa bwambura.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahura mwa Bushenge Bukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Niabanatwala Yesu ira mwa shebakungu mukulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa ndungo ya Bayahuti mwabaa munaba shebakungu mukulu muuma, yabaa anaimanira aboshebakungu boshe.</char></note>, na bemanitsi boshe ba bakungu, na bangumwa, na beyisa ba Muomba boshe, niabanabuanana aho. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petero nianakulikira Yesu kashando bunono, abaneingira mwa kati ka mbuwa ya shebakungu. Nianaikala hauma na basura, kweota kwa muchanwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />aBoshebakungu, na bakulukulu ba <char style="w" lemma="Bushenge Bukulu">Bushenge Bukulu</char> niabanaxonda kaliho ke songera Yesu kwebula mbu bamwite. Wetuwe batabonekyakyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Bandu bangi niabanamuhambika binwa, wetuwe abinwa byobapfula ni bite byobiuma. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Bauma mubo niabanabatuka kwepfula myatsi ya bubesi kuluenda iye mbu: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Itwe twaumpfaa ni aneena mbu: ‹Ingye nikashambula <char style="w" lemma="hekalu">ahekalu</char> iyi yoyahimbwaa na bandu, na mu biro bishatu nikahimba indi yoitahimbirwe na bandu.›» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Wetuwe nakiro lwaba lutyo, abinwa byobamusongera ni bite byobiuma. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Niyo shebakungu mukulu abatuka mwa mubuanano, nebutsa Yesu mbu: «Kuutauxubya ku kiro na kinwa?» Abandu aba abakusongera kubwishi bwaki? <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Yesu nianatsira ataxubya kiro kinwa. Shebakungu nianamubutsa kandi mbu: «Mbeni iwe we Kirisitu, Muala wa Ongo yalirene isingibwa?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Ingye, ngye iye! Nemwe mukaxunga, Muala wa Mundu ni aikere kwa malyo ma Ongo Nina Maala. Mukamuxunga kandi ni awicha mwa bipfu bya mu mbingu!» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Shebakungu abere ahulikya abinwa ibi, nianaberenga asangimba siwe, nebula mbu: «Tutakilaire ku kandi kaliho kwa mundu uyu! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mwameiumpfira mwenabene ku amekamba Ongo. Amuanikira mute?» Aboshe niabanamuchira lubancha kwalirene ipfa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Na bandi mubo niabanatangira ichira ku Yesu ko mate, niabanamuxwika mwa busu, nemukubita mpfundo, nemubwira mbu: «Kola butahwa, tubwire inde yamekukubita!» Na basura nabo niabanamutsimba nemukubita bihyu.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero aiana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petero abaa akinali hetako mwa mbuwa ya kyumba kyo Yesu abaa ahuriramo, mucha muuma wa shebakungu nianahika aho. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Abere axunga ku Petero kwaota kwa muchanwa, nianamusindera, nemubwira mbu: «Iwe nawe wabaa kuuma ne Yesu we Nasareti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Wetuwe Petero nianaiana mbu: «Nitechi, neri nitechi abinwa byouxonda ineena.» Inyuma kwaho, nianahuluka neya kwa lukyo lwa ira mbua. Niyo axongole yakokobika.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Wetuwe amucha uyo nianamuxunga aho, netangira ineena kandi na bobabaa aho mbu: «Amundu uyu muuma wa mwa bemitsa bewe.» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Wetuwe Petero nianaiana kandi. Inyuma hake, abandu abo niabanabwira Petero kandi mbu: «Mwa kuli uli muuma wa mwa bemitsa bewe, kubwishi uli mwicha i Ngalilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Niyo Petero atangira ineena mbu: «Nitukangwe, niri anineena bubesi! Anilahitsa ku ndechi amundu yomuahula uyu!» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Abere ameotola ineena atyo, axongole niainakokobika ngendo ya kabiri. Petero nianaubuka abinwa byo Yesu amubwiraa mbu: «Buxondotsi axongole ikokobike ngendo ya kabiri, ukaba ni wameiana ingye kashatu, mbu utanichi.» Ni yatangira ilira!<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu mwa mbere sa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:14">14:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Mwe lutumbi, boshebakungu, na bangumwa, na beyisa ba Muomba, na bakulukulu boshe ba Bushenge Bukulu, niabanamina kinwa kyetsimba Yesu. Niabanamutsimba nemutwalira Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato nianabutsa Yesu mbu: «Mbeni iwe we mwami wa Bayahuti?» Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Wamebulako.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Boshebakungu niabanasongera Yesu binwa bingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Niyo Pilato amubutsa kandi mbu: «Iwe kuutauxubya kiro na kinwa? Talola ku binwa bingana byobakusongera!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Wetuwe Yesu ataxubya kandi kiro na kinwa kyoshekyoshe. Pilato naye nianashishala.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu achirwa lubancha lwa lupfu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoh 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Mu kintsi lwire lukulu lwa Pasaka, Pilato abaa muhanga welikulirabo mundu muuma wa muliki, yobabaa bashashire. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Habaa mundu muuma wa muliki yalukwa mbu ye Baraba, aminwaa kuuma na batengu kubwishi bwa bwiti mu kianiro kya kahinchangano. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Abandu niabanaendera Pilato, nemuhema mbu akolerebo nga kwatula aira. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato nianabutsabo mbu: «Amuxonda mbu nibalikulire amwami wa Bayahuti?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Abulaa atyo ni echi ku boshebakungu bamehana Yesu kwemupfira muono.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Wetuwe boshebakungu, niabanaisiritsa abandu mbu baheme Pilato mbu alikulirebo Baraba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato nianabutsa abandu kandi mbu: «Mbeni amuxonda mbu niire amundu yomuluka mbu mwami wa Bayahuti yonde!» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Niabanamuxubyitsa ni abalaka mbu: «Umuhangike ku musalaba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato nianabutsabo mbu: «Mbeni kihe kibi kyakolire!» Wetuwe niabanalaka kutsibu mbu: «Umuhangike ku musalaba!»<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato kwexonda imoya bandu, nianalikulirabo Baraba. Nianakalihya mbu bakubite Yesu yo ngonyi nemuhana mbu ahangikwe ku musalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abasura bashekenyula Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-30">Mat 27:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Abasura niabanatwala Yesu mwa mbuwa ya nyumba ya kafurunere. Niabanabirangira akindi kichiri kyoshe kya basura. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Niabanaimbakya Yesu kantsu ka ngola netsinga ngata ya ndabi sa mahwa nemuimbakyayo kwa mutwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Inyuma kwaho, niyo bamuketsa mbu: «Waliha mwami wa Bayahuti! Atukuketsa!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Niabanamukubita lusheke kwa mutwe, bamuchirako mate, neshinga amapfi, kwepfukama mwa mbere siwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Babere bamemushekenyula, niabanamukungula akantsu ka ngola ako, nemuimbakya asangimba siwe kandi. Niabanaenda naye ira mbuwa kweya imuhangika kwa musalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahangikwa kwa musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Mundu muuma we Kurene, yabaa alukwa mbu ye Simoni, ishe wa Lekisandere ne Rufu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rufu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Baroma 16:13. </char></note> nianatsuka aho ni atenga mwa ixwa. Abasura bamuminga iheka amusalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Niabanatwala Yesu hohalukwa mbu «Kolikota», rebula mbu: «Handu ha Kahangatsi.» <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Niabanamuha tifai ixubene na makali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tifai ixubene na makali: Kixomyo kyepfibwa kinahabwa mundu y'akahangikwa ku musalaba kwekehya abwaale.</char></note>, wetuwe nianatinda ixomayo. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Inyuma kwaho, niabanamuhangika ku musalaba, niabanaabana asangimba siwe mu ikuba mbayi kwemenya amuhango wa kintsi mundu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 22:19.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Sabaa saa ishatu sa makyerakyera bali yo bamuhangika kwa musalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Niabanaandika abinwa byobituma achirwa lubancha mbu: «Mwami wa Bayahuti!» <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Niabanamuhangika kuuma na bandi banyai babiri, muuma kwa malyo na undi kwa malembe. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />aMaandiko Makomire momabwire mbu: «Ahirwaa hauma na bakotsi ba bibi,»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 53:12.</char></note> niamanabarerera.<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Na bobabaa abatsuka aho, babaa abamukamba, niabatinganya amitwe yabo mbu: «Iwe wowabaa auxonda ishambula ahekalu nehimba indi mu biro bishatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />tsene uiufule wenawene, uikimye na kwa musalaba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Aboshebakungu, kuuma na beyisa ba Muomba niabanashekenyula Yesu mbu: «Aufulaa abandi, wetuwe tsene amelemwa iiufula yewene. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ewo! Ali ye Kirisitu, mwami wa Baisiraeri, tsene aikimye kwa musalaba, kwebula mbu netwe tulole, nemwimirira.» Banabe na bobahangikwaa kuuma naye, nabo babaa ni abanamukamba.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arepfa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kabere kahara kati ka mwishi niakunatowa mutsimya kwa kihuo kyoshe, ihika mu saa mwenda. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Saa mwenda sabere saeraho, Yesu nianalaka mu mulenge mule mbu: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lama sabakitani!» Rebula mbu: «Ongo wani, Ongo wani, wamenisiya kuki?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 22:2.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bandu bauma bobabaa bali aho, babere bahulikya kwameneena, babula mbu: «Muumpfe! Abirangira Eliya!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Muuma mubo nianalibita, nianabobetsa fufuma mu tifai iyaire neminayo ku lusheke. Inyuma kwaho nianaurukitsayo Yesu kwebula mbu axomeyo, neneena mbu: «Lika tulole ngakuno Eliya akawicha imukimya kwa musalaba.» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Wetuwe Yesu nianalaka mu mulenge mule, netowa amwete.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Apasiya ya mwa hekalu niainabereka bihande bibiri itangira ira luulu ihikira hashi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Amukulukulu wa basura yabaa aimene mwa mbere sa Yesu, abere axunga ko Yesu ametowa amwete, niananeena mbu: «Mwa kuli, amundu uyu anabaa Muala wa Ongo!»<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Aho, habaa bakatsi bauma ni abaloleketsa hale, mubo ni muli, Mariya we Makitala, ne Mariya nina wa Yakobo, ne Yose, ne Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Abakatsi abo bobakulikiraa Yesu nemukolera mwa mango abaa ali i Ngalilaya. Na bandi bakatsi bangi bamukulikiraa ihikira i Yerusalemu, nabo babaa bali aho.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aretabwa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Lwabere lwahara luoloolo, lwa lwire lwareiteanya aSabato, Yosefu we Arimateya nianahika ira mwa Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefu uyo abaa mwicha i Arimateya, naye ni apfirwe xoni mwa Bushenge Bukulu. Abaa ni alindirire arehika ra Bwami bwa Ongo. Nianaya ira mwa Pilato butsira buba kwehema andundwe ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato nianaishalima kutsibu kweumpfa mbu Yesu amekinda ipfa. Kubatyo, Pilato nianabirangira amukulukulu wa basura nemubutsa ngakuno kwametsuka kashangiki Yesu atoire amwete. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilato abere aumpfa amuxubyo wa mukulukulu uyo, nianaha Yosefu yo rubu kweheka andundwe ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefu nianaya iula lushangi lwa kichiro kinene, nianatengya amubiri wa Yesu kwa musalaba, nianabungabungirao mwa lushangi ulo, nianaya itao mu isinda rolitimirwe mu lukanga. Inyuma kwaho, nianahiringitya ibale linene kwa lukyo lwa resinda. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mariya we Makitala, ne Mariya nina wa Yose, babaa abasindera ho Yesu aterekwaa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Arepfuka ra Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-8">Luk 24:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1">Yoh 20:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 20:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Alwire lwa Sabato lwabere lwametsuka, Mariya we Makitala, ne Mariya nina wa Yakobo, na undi mukatsi yalukwa mbu ye Salome, niabanaula lungo kweya ihakalo kwa ndundwe ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mwe lutumbi kutsibu, lwa lwire lubere lwa reinga, mwehuluka ra retsuba, niabanalamukira kwesinda. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bereenda niababutsabutsanya mbu: «Mbeni inde yakatuhiringityitsa arebale roliri kwa lukyo lwa resinda!» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Wetuwe babere babatula amesha, niabanalola kwa arebale lisiikirwe ira musike. Arebale iro, rabaa linene kutsibu. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Niabanaingira mwesinda umo, niabanaxunga mutabana muuma ni aikere kwa munda wa malyo, ni aimbere kantsu ka mweru. Niabanaishalima.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Wetuwe amutabana uyo, nianabwirabo mbu: «Mutaishalimaa, amuxonda Yesu we Nasareti, yobahangikaa kwa musalaba. Amepfuka, atali hano. Mulole hobabaa bamuterekire.» <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Tsene Muende yomubwire abemitsa bewe, ne Petero mbu: «Amebaxondolera i Ngalilaya, iyo yomukamuxungirako, ngakuno kwababwiraa.» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Niabanatenga kwesinda ro Yesu atabwaamo ni abalibita. Ni abatitimana neshishala kutsibu. Batabwira mundu woshewoshe kubwishi ni baubahire ali ate Petero ho. Bibe bityo.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfumbukira ku Mariya we Makitala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoh 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu abere amepfuka mwelutumbi lwa lwire lubere lwa reinga, nianapfumbukira kasa ku Mariya we Makitala, yahentsaamo abixwatsi birinda.<verse eid="MRK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Mariya uyo nianaya ipfula amwatsi ku bo Yesu abaa kuuma nabo. Babaa bayongirwe nelira. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Wetuwe babere bahulikya kwaneena mbu Yesu aliho, na ko Mariya amuxungaa, batamwimirira.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ampfumbukira ku bemitsa babiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianapfumbukira ku bemitsa bewe babiri mu indi shushani. Abemitsa abobabaa baya mwa kihya. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Babere bafuluka, niabanapfulira abandi bemitsa amwatsi uyo, wetuwe ibo, bataimirira.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ampfumbukira kwa bemitsa ikumi na muuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:6-8">Mik 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Mwa ntsindiro, Yesu nianapfumbukira kwa bemitsa bewe ikumi na muuma ni abalya. Nianakemerabo kwetinda iimirira, na kubwishi bwa myete yabo mitsibu. Akemeraabo atyo, kubwishi bataimiriraa bobamuxungaa amepfuka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Inyuma kwaho, nianabwirabo mbu: «Muende mwa kihuo kyoshe mupfule aMwatsi Mubuya kwa bandu boshe. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yakawimirira, nerubikwa akaufukala. Wetuwe yatiwimirire akachirwa lubancha. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Na tulolero totukakulikira aboshe bobakawimirira ni totuno: bakerehentsa abixwatsi mwetsina rani, bakereneena mu mineenere mihya, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />nakiro batsimba ku nchoka mu minwe neri ilya kindu kyoshekyoshe kyokingaita, kitendeirabo kubi. Bakerehira asaminwe sabo ku bakoni, nabo benderelama.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akukumwa mu mbingu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MIC 1:9-11">Mik 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Abere ameneena atyo, Ninakuwetu Yesu, nianakukumwa mu mbingu neikala kwa malyo ma Ongo. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Abemitsa niabanaya ipfula aMwatsi Mubuya ahoshe. Ninakuwetu abaa erekola kuuma nabo, nebereretsa akuli ya Mwatsi Mubuya mu tulolero.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>